(25, 'LIN-KAT', NULL, NULL, 2, 'lin-kat', 'subsubcategories/1770881299.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770881299_5265.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770881299_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>LIN KAT FRP Planters – Premium Linear Bowl-Style Planters for Modern Décor</strong></h3><p>The LIN KAT Series features a sophisticated linear bowl-shaped FRP planter, designed to bring elegance, structure, and balance to both indoor and outdoor spaces. With its elongated, sleek contour, the LIN KAT planter stands out as a perfect blend of modern design and functional versatility.</p><p><strong>Shape Specialization</strong></p><p><strong>Linear Bowl Design</strong></p><ul><li>A stylish fusion of a bowl and elongated tray form, offering a contemporary look</li><li>Smooth, streamlined profile ideal for creating long, continuous planting arrangements</li><li>Wide top surface that allows plants to spread beautifully and form symmetrical displays</li></ul><p><strong>This shape is perfect for:</strong></p><ul><li>Creating linear green borders</li><li>Highlighting long balconies, corridors, window fronts</li><li>Designing elegant centerpiece arrangements for lobbies or outdoor patios</li></ul><p><strong>Customization Options</strong></p><p>The LIN KAT planter range can be customized to match your architectural or landscape theme:</p><ul><li>Sizes: Available in multiple lengths, widths, and depths for residential to commercial-scale projects</li><li>Colors: Choose from matte, glossy, textured, metallic, or custom shades to complement your décor</li></ul><p>This flexibility ensures a perfect fit for modern homes, hotels, offices, and luxury outdoor landscapes.</p><p>Ideal Usage Areas</p><p><strong>LIN KAT FRP planters are excellent for:</strong></p><ul><li>Balcony railings, window ledges, and terrace fronts</li><li>Office corridors, reception zones, and boutique stores</li><li>Poolside arrangements, garden walkways, and outdoor café setups</li><li>Minimalist indoor corners or long console tables</li></ul><p>Their elongated bowl shape makes them ideal for creating harmonious plant groupings and visual flow.</p><p><strong>Why Choose LIN KAT FRP Planters?</strong></p><ul><li>Lightweight yet strong and weather-resistant</li><li>UV-stable, durable, and crack-resistant</li><li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor planting</li><li>Low maintenance with long-lasting finish</li></ul><p>Enhance your space with LIN KAT FRP Linear Bowl Planters, crafted for designers seeking clean lines, modern aesthetics, and functional beauty.</p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'LIN KAT Linear Bowl Planters - FRP Collection', 'Linear bowl-style FRP planters ideal for balconies, corridors and modern landscapes.', 'lin kat planter, linear bowl planter, frp tray bowl', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 14:28:19'),
(26, 'MGF BALL', 'MGF BALL', 'MGF BALL', 2, 'mgf-ball', 'subsubcategories/1770881447.jpg', 'MGF BALL', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770881447_5723.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770881447_3760.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770881447_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>MGF BALL &ndash; Premium Spherical FRP Planters for Modern &amp; Luxury Spaces</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The MGF BALL Series is a standout model in the FRP bowls &amp; round-shaped planter category. Designed with a perfectly sculpted spherical body, this planter brings a timeless and elegant aesthetic suitable for both contemporary and classic d&eacute;cor styles.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Shape Specialization</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Perfect Spherical Form</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Features a smooth, rounded ball shape that adds visual softness and harmony to any setting</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Offers a balanced 360&deg; appearance, making it ideal as a focal statement piece</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The generous internal volume supports medium to large plants, shrubs, and decorative arrangements</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The signature ball shape enhances symmetry and creates an instant luxurious touch in any environment.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Customization Options</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The MGF BALL planter can be tailored to your design preferences:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes: Multiple diameters available to suit tabletops, floor placement, or outdoor landscaping</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Colors: Customizable in matte, glossy, metallic, stone-finish, textured, and premium designer shades</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This flexibility ensures the MGF BALL planter complements any architectural or landscaping theme.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Where to Use MGF BALL Planters Effectively</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>This spherical design is ideal for:</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Entrances &amp; Lobbies: Adds a grand visual impact</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Balconies &amp; Terraces: Perfect for corner placements or paired sets</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Garden Landscapes: Enhances pathways, lawns, and poolside areas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office Interiors: Works well as a statement d&eacute;cor piece in cabins or waiting areas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotels, Resorts &amp; Restaurants: Creates premium ambiance with curated green displays</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The elegant ball shape blends seamlessly with both minimalist and luxury design settings.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Why Choose MGF BALL FRP Planters?</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Lightweight yet highly durable FRP construction</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Weather-resistant, UV-stable, and suitable for indoor &amp; outdoor use</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crack-resistant, corrosion-free, and long-lasting</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low maintenance with superior finish quality</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Enhance your space with the MGF BALL FRP Planter&mdash;a perfect combination of artistic form, modern durability, and designer appeal.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774438182_69c3c726352c2.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'MGF Ball Planters - FRP Fibre Collection', 'Spherical FRP ball planters for luxury interiors and outdoor landscaping.', 'mgf ball planter, spherical frp planter, ball planter', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:29:53'),
(27, 'MGF-KTR', NULL, NULL, 2, 'mgf-ktr', 'subsubcategories/1770881532.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770881532_6255.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770881532_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>MGF KTR – Premium FRP Bowl Planters with Elegant Curved Form</strong></h3><p>The MGF KTR Series belongs to the FRP bowls category, known for its smooth curvature and refined aesthetics. Designed with a deep, rounded KTR-shaped body, this planter offers both style and functionality—perfect for modern interiors, premium landscapes, and architectural décor projects.</p><p><strong>Shape Specialization</strong></p><p><strong>Deep Curved Bowl Design</strong></p><ul><li>Features a rounded bowl silhouette with a slight taper, giving it a sleek and balanced appearance</li><li>Offers excellent depth for supporting medium to large plants, flowering arrangements, and ornamental displays</li><li>The seamless curvature makes it visually soothing and ideal for creating symmetrical décor themes</li></ul><p>Its bowl-like geometry makes the MGF KTR planter versatile and visually appealing in almost any setting.</p><p><strong>Customization Options</strong></p><p>The MGF KTR planter is fully customizable to meet diverse design needs:</p><ul><li>Sizes: Available in multiple depth and diameter combinations for indoor and outdoor use</li><li>Colors: Offered in matte, glossy, metallic, stone-finish, terrazzo-texture, and custom designer shades</li></ul><p>This ensures perfect harmony with residential, commercial, and landscape environments.</p><p>Where to Use MGF KTR Planters Effectively</p><p><strong>This bowl-shaped model is ideal for:</strong></p><ul><li>Residential Gardens &amp; Patios: Perfect for flowering plants and decorative shrubs</li><li>Hotel Lobbies &amp; Reception Areas: Enhances luxury ambiance with rounded sculptural presence</li><li>Balconies &amp; Terraces: Works well both as a single centerpiece or in grouped arrangements</li><li>Office Interiors: Adds softness and organic flow to professional spaces</li><li>Architectural Landscaping: Suitable for pathways, open lounges, pool decks, and green installations</li></ul><p>The MGF KTR eliminates harsh lines and introduces smooth, modern elegance.</p><p><strong>Why Choose MGF KTR FRP Planters?</strong></p><ul><li>Lightweight yet extremely durable FRP construction</li><li>UV-resistant, weatherproof, and suitable for indoor/outdoor locations</li><li>Crack-resistant, corrosion-proof, and long-lasting</li><li>Premium finishing with minimal maintenance requirements</li></ul><p>Enhance your décor with the MGF KTR FRP Planter—a perfect blend of modern curves, long-lasting quality, and designer versatility.</p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'MGF KTR Bowl Planters - FRP Collection', 'Deep curved FRP bowl planters for premium indoor and outdoor décor.', 'mgf ktr planter, bowl frp planter, designer bowl planter', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 14:32:12'),
(28, 'TIBET BOWL', 'TIBET BOWL', 'TIBET BOWL', 2, 'tibet-bowl', 'subsubcategories/1770881680.jpg', 'TIBET BOWL', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770881680_4077.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770881680_4869.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770881680_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>Tibet Bowl &ndash; Premium FRP Bowl Planter with Elegant Traditional Curves</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Tibet Bowl belongs to the FRP bowls category, designed with a graceful, traditional-inspired shape that enhances both modern and classic d&eacute;cor themes. Its rounded, wide-mouth bowl profile provides a perfect balance of aesthetics and functionality&mdash;ideal for statement planters, floral displays, and premium landscaping projects.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Shape Specialization</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Wide, Deep Bowl Silhouette</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Features a broad open-top bowl with smooth curvature that gives it a striking yet minimal look</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Generous depth allows for lush plantations such as ornamental plants, succulents, palms, and floral arrangements</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The soft, rounded geometry creates a serene visual appeal suitable for both indoor and outdoor environments</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Tibet Bowl&rsquo;s elegant bowl design makes it a versatile centerpiece for premium spaces.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Customization Options</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Tibet Bowl FRP planter is fully customizable with:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple Sizes: From compact tabletop bowls to large landscape pieces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Wide Color Range: Available in matte, gloss, metallic, stone-finish, rustic textures, and custom designer shades</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This flexibility ensures seamless integration with any residential, commercial, or hospitality d&eacute;cor theme.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Where to Use Tibet Bowl Planters Effectively</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Perfect for enhancing a variety of spaces, including:</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotel Lobbies &amp; Luxury Receptions: Creates a grand visual statement</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Living Rooms &amp; Patio Corners: Works beautifully as a decorative focal point</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Terraces &amp; Balconies: Ideal for themed plantations or bowl garden setups</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Resort Landscaping &amp; Pool Decks: Adds softness and elegance to open spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office Lounges &amp; Corporate Entrances: Balances modern architecture with organic aesthetics</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its wide bowl shape makes it suitable for both single plant displays and mixed arrangements.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Why Choose the Tibet Bowl FRP Planter?</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Premium-quality FRP construction&mdash;lightweight, durable, and long-lasting</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Weatherproof, UV-resistant, and suitable for indoor/outdoor use</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crack-proof, maintenance-friendly, and elegant in all climates</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modular sizes and finish options to match any design requirement</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Elevate your d&eacute;cor with the Tibet Bowl FRP Planter&mdash;a perfect blend of modern sophistication, traditional charm, and superior craftsmanship.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774438386_69c3c7f20ba14.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Tibet Bowl Planters - FRP Fibre Collection', 'Wide-mouth FRP bowl planters with traditional elegance and modern durability.', 'tibet bowl planter, frp bowl planter, decorative bowl planter', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:33:15'),
