style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774438473_69c3c849024cd.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'UAP KTR Bowl Planters - FRP Collection', 'Elegant tapered FRP bowl planters for luxury interiors and landscapes.', 'uap ktr planter, frp bowl planter, premium planters', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:34:44'),
(30, 'UFO', 'UFO', 'UFO', 2, 'ufo', 'subsubcategories/1770886470.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770886470_8483.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770886470_7101.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770886470_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>UFO &ndash; Modern FRP Bowl Planters for Contemporary D&eacute;cor</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The UFO FRP Planter features a unique, wide-rimmed bowl design inspired by soft, futuristic contours. Its smooth, rounded shape adds a modern and artistic touch, making it perfect for elevating both interior and exterior spaces. Designed for durability and style, this planter is ideal for statement greenery setups and decorative landscaping.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Shape Specialization</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Wide Circular Bowl with a Distinct Curved Profile</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Engineered with a broad top opening and a gently rounded body, offering ample planting space</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The UFO-style silhouette gives it a futuristic look, making it stand out as a premium d&eacute;cor element</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its smooth curvature highlights plant arrangements beautifully, making it ideal for ornamental plants, succulents, bonsai, and centerpiece gardens</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The UFO bowl shape is perfect for adding dimension and elegance to contemporary environments.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Customization Options</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The UFO FRP Planter can be tailored to your design needs with:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple sizes &ndash; from compact tabletop bowls to large outdoor statement pieces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color customization &ndash; matte, gloss, stone textures, metallic finishes, and custom designer shades</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This flexibility ensures seamless integration into any architectural or landscape theme.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Best Used For</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The UFO bowl planter enhances various interior and exterior settings, including:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotel lobbies &amp; luxury resorts &ndash; as decorative focal pieces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Living rooms, lounges &amp; modern homes &ndash; perfect for coffee table or floor d&eacute;cor</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Terraces, balconies &amp; patios &ndash; ideal for creating elegant bowl gardens</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Poolside decks &amp; courtyards &ndash; adds a stylish and serene look</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office entrances &amp; corporate lounges &ndash; complements contemporary architecture</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its futuristic bowl design makes it perfect for both standalone displays and grouped arrangements.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose UFO FRP Planters?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Lightweight, weather-resistant, and long-lasting</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">UV-resistant and suitable for indoor &amp; outdoor use</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crack-proof, low maintenance, and premium quality</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customizable for any d&eacute;cor or landscaping requirement</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Elevate your modern spaces with the UFO FRP Bowl Planters&mdash;where futuristic design meets durable craftsmanship.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774438542_69c3c88e1941c.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'UFO Bowl Planters - FRP Fibre Collection', 'Modern UFO-shaped FRP bowl planters for contemporary indoor and outdoor décor.', 'ufo planter, frp bowl planter, modern bowl planter', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:35:53'),
(38, 'BOT-CUT', 'BOT-CUT', 'BOT-CUT', 3, 'bot-cut', 'subsubcategories/1770886727.jpg', 'BOT-CUT', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770886727_7787.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770886727_4651.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770886727_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>BOT CUT &ndash; Geometrical FRP Planter</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The BOT CUT planter is a modern geometrical FRP design known for its sharp cuts, clean edges, and balanced proportions. Its structured silhouette brings a contemporary aesthetic to any indoor or outdoor space, making it a popular choice for architects, landscapers, and interior designers.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The BOT CUT planter features:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A distinct geometrical profile with precise cut detailing</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A blend of cube-inspired structure with softened top contours</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A stable, upright form ideal for tall and medium-height plants</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A visually striking shape that adds dimension to minimal and luxury spaces</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This shape is specifically crafted to give a premium architectural look while maintaining functionality and versatility.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">To match different design themes, the BOT CUT planter can be customized in:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple sizes for residential, commercial, and landscape use</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Any color finish including matte, gloss, stone, wooden, and metallic</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Special textures on request</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bulk customization available for hotels, offices, and large projects</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The BOT CUT geometrical planter is perfect for:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern home interiors &amp; balcony d&eacute;cor</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Corporate offices, reception areas, and meeting rooms</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotel lobbies, resort pathways &amp; luxury outdoor lounges</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Retail stores, showrooms, and premium display areas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Terrace gardens, walkways, and landscape architecture</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its structured shape complements both natural greens and ornamental plants beautifully.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose BOT CUT?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Architecturally appealing geometrical design</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">FRP material ensures it is lightweight, durable, weatherproof, and crack-resistant</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Easy to maintain and suitable for indoor and outdoor use</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Blends seamlessly with minimalist, contemporary, or luxury themes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Provides a refined, premium look to any environment</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774438650_69c3c8fa4982f.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'BOT-CUT', 'BOT-CUT', 'BOT-CUT', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:37:46'),
(39, 'EGHO', 'EGHO', 'EGHO', 3, 'egho', 'subsubcategories/1770886996.jpg', 'EGHO', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770886996_8373.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770886996_5175.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770886996_6567.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770886996_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>EGHO &ndash; Geometrical FRP Planter</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The EGHO planter stands out with its elegant geometrical form, designed to bring a refined yet modern touch to any space. With its smooth curves, structured body, and premium FRP construction, EGHO is an excellent choice for enhancing both indoor and outdoor environments with a bold, contemporary aesthetic.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>The EGHO planter features:</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A unique geometrical silhouette with rounded edges and balanced curvature</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A design that blends soft oval forms with angular precision</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A wider top opening, ideal for showcasing lush foliage and decorative plants</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A stable, grounded base that ensures durability and visual harmony</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its shape is crafted to create a sophisticated statement while offering great planting depth and versatility.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>The EGHO FRP planter can be tailored to match any project requirement with:</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple size options for residential, commercial, or landscape applications</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom colors in matte, glossy, metallic, wooden, stone, terracotta, and more</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Special textures and finishes available upon request</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bulk customization support for hotels, offices, and premium outdoor projects</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>The EGHO geometrical planter is ideal for:</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern home interiors, living rooms, and balconies</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office entrances, reception areas, and workspace d&eacute;cor</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotels, luxury resorts, and landscape pathways</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Showrooms, malls, and high-end retail environments</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Terrace gardens and outdoor lounges</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its smooth yet structured form suits both minimalist and luxury modern themes.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Why Choose EGHO?</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Stylish geometrical shape that enhances any d&eacute;cor style</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crafted from high-quality FRP, making it lightweight, weather-resistant, and extremely durable</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Suitable for indoor and outdoor environments</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low maintenance with long-lasting color and finish</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Adds a premium, artistic touch to any setting</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774438738_69c3c952a23e6.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'EGHO', 'EGHO', 'EGHO', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:39:12'),
(40, 'GEODE', NULL, NULL, 3, 'geode', 'subsubcategories/1770887030.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770887030_5306.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770887030_3219.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770887030_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>GEODE – Geometrical FRP Planter</h3><p>The GEODE planter is designed to make a bold visual impact with its sharp, sculpted edges and modern geometric form. Crafted from premium FRP, this planter blends architectural aesthetics with functional durability—perfect for contemporary interior and exterior landscapes.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The GEODE’s design features:</p><ul><li>A distinct angular, faceted structure inspired by natural geode formations</li><li>Clean geometric lines that create a striking sculptural look</li><li>A stable base with a wide top opening for effortless planting</li><li>A design that adds depth, dimension, and artistic flair to any space</li></ul><p>Its geometric cuts and facets make it a standout option for modern décor themes.</p><p>Customization Options</p><p>Tailor the GEODE planter to your project needs with:</p><ul><li>Multiple size variations – from compact indoor models to large outdoor statement pieces</li><li>Customizable colors including matte, gloss, metallic, stone, and concrete finishes</li><li>Textured surfaces available upon request</li><li>Bulk customization support for commercial and landscaping projects</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><p>The GEODE geometrical planter is ideal for:</p><ul><li>Modern homes, luxury apartments, and balcony décor</li><li>Office entrances, corporate lobbies, and meeting areas</li><li>Stylish hotels, resorts, cafés, and premium outdoor lounges</li><li>Landscape architecture, poolside décor, and walkways</li><li>Retail stores, showrooms, and art-inspired spaces</li></ul><p>Its striking geometric look fits perfectly in contemporary and statement décor settings.</p><p>Why Choose GEODE?</p><ul><li>Architectural and artistic geometric shape that elevates any space</li><li>Made from high-quality FRP, offering durability, weather resistance, and lightweight handling</li><li>Long-lasting colors that do not fade easily</li><li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor environments</li><li>Low maintenance and easy to clean</li><li>Adds a premium, designer touch to your décor</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:03:50'),
(41, 'KYT', NULL, NULL, 3, 'kyt', 'subsubcategories/1770887442.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770887442_1173.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770887442_8610.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770887442_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>KYT – Geometrical FRP Planter</h3><p>The KYT planter stands out for its sleek, contemporary profile shaped with clean geometric precision. Designed for modern landscapes, interiors, and architectural spaces, KYT combines minimalism with a bold sculptural identity—perfect for those who prefer sharp lines and premium aesthetics.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The KYT planter features:</p><ul><li>A unique tapering geometric form with well-defined edges</li><li>A modern box-meets-angular silhouette that enhances vertical and horizontal spaces</li><li>A stable, balanced base suitable for medium to large plants</li><li>A shape that adds a touch of architectural elegance to any décor</li></ul><p>Its structured design makes it an ideal choice for contemporary and luxury environments.</p><p>Customization Options</p><p>KYT can be customized to align perfectly with residential, commercial, and landscaping needs:</p><ul><li>Multiple size options—small, medium, large, and oversized</li><li>Custom colors including matte, gloss, textured, stone, metallic, and concrete finishes</li><li>Branding and theme-based designs for commercial projects</li><li>Bulk customization available for hotels, offices, and outdoor installations</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><p>The KYT planter is versatile and ideal for:</p><ul><li>Modern homes, balconies, and terrace gardens</li><li>Corporate offices, reception areas, and conference rooms</li><li>Hotel lobbies, luxury resorts, and fine-dining spaces</li><li>Outdoor pathways, poolside areas, and landscaped gardens</li><li>Retail showrooms, malls, and art-inspired interiors</li></ul><p>Its shape complements structured and minimalist décor themes beautifully.</p><p>Why Choose KYT?</p><ul><li>Distinct geometric silhouette that instantly enhances visual appeal</li><li>Crafted from high-quality FRP, ensuring durability, lightweight handling, and weather resistance</li><li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor spaces</li><li>Fade-resistant and long-lasting surface finishes</li><li>Low maintenance and easy to clean</li><li>Adds a refined, premium, and modern touch to any space</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:10:42'),
(42, 'PEBBLE', 'PEBBLE', 'PEBBLE', 3, 'pebble', 'subsubcategories/1770897199.png', 'PEBBLE', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770897199_8583.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770897199_3668.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770897200_4434.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770897199_breadcrumb.png', '<h3><strong>Pebble &ndash; Geometrical FRP Planter</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Pebble planter brings the calm and organic beauty of nature into modern spaces. Inspired by naturally smooth river pebbles, this FRP planter features soft curves and a rounded geometric form that adds harmony and sophistication wherever it is placed.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Pebble planter is known for:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A smooth, rounded, pebble-like silhouette</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Soft, flowing curves that create a warm and inviting aesthetic</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A stable low-to-mid height structure perfect for wide-root plants</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A natural, organic look ideal for nature-inspired design themes</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its balanced, sculptural shape blends seamlessly with minimalist, contemporary, and biophilic interiors.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Pebble planter can be tailored to suit any d&eacute;cor or landscape:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Available in multiple sizes &mdash; from compact tabletop styles to grand landscape pieces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom color options &mdash; matte, gloss, metallic, stone, rustic, textured, and earthy finishes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Theme-based customization for hotels, resorts, offices, and luxury homes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bulk customization available for large projects and commercial sites</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Pebble planter is versatile and works beautifully in:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Living rooms, balconies, and modern home interiors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotel lobbies, spa zones, and wellness centers</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Outdoor garden pathways, pool decks, patios, and terraces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Resorts, villas, and nature-themed spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office lounges, breakout areas, and reception corners</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its natural form makes it ideal for enhancing relaxing, calming, and premium environments.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Pebble?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Nature-inspired geometric shape that adds warmth and elegance</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Made from premium FRP, ensuring durability, lightweight handling, and long-lasting performance</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Weather-resistant and suitable for indoor and outdoor use</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Fade-free, crack-resistant surface finish</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low maintenance and easy to clean</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Brings a soft, contemporary, and organic style to any setting</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774438863_69c3c9cfa9e99.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'PEBBLE', 'PEBBLE', 'PEBBLE', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:41:12');
