(43, 'SLANTO', 'SLANTO', 'SLANTO', 3, 'slanto', 'subsubcategories/1770887620.jpg', 'SLANTO', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770887620_2471.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770887620_5284.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770887620_1186.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770887620_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>SLANTO &ndash; Geometrical FRP Planter</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Slanto planter brings a bold, modern design statement to any space with its clean geometric lines and stylish slanted profile. Crafted from premium FRP, this planter adds an architectural edge, making it perfect for contemporary interiors and sophisticated landscapes.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Slanto planter is defined by:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A unique slanted geometric silhouette that creates a dynamic visual appeal</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Clean, sharp edges for a striking, modern aesthetic</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A tall, sleek structure ideal for plants that complement vertical designs</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A sculptural form that enhances minimalistic and architectural settings</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its tilted design makes it stand out as a feature piece while blending seamlessly with urban d&eacute;cor.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Slanto planters can be customized to match any project or d&eacute;cor requirement:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple size options &mdash; from medium-height planters to tall statement pieces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom colors available &mdash; gloss, matte, stone, metallic, wooden, and textured finishes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Brand-specific or theme-based customizations for hotels, offices, and large landscape projects</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization for indoor or outdoor application</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Slanto planter is ideal for:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Corporate offices, reception areas, and meeting lounges</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern homes, balconies, and entrance foyers</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotels, restaurants, and high-design commercial spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Poolside landscaping, terrace gardens, and patios</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Showrooms, galleries, and architectural installations</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its bold shape elevates any setting where a premium, designer look is required.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Slanto?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Eye-catching geometric slanted design perfect for modern architecture</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Made from high-quality FRP, offering strength, light weight, and long-lasting durability</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">100% weather-resistant &mdash; suitable for both indoor and outdoor use</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Fade-proof, corrosion-free, and crack-resistant finish</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Easy to maintain, easy to move, and built to retain its shape and color</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A perfect blend of function, aesthetics, and premium craftsmanship</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774438959_69c3ca2f01ae6.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'SLANTO', 'SLANTO', 'SLANTO', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:42:48'),
(44, 'SLANTRA', 'SLANTRA', 'SLANTRA', 3, 'slantra', 'subsubcategories/1770887721.jpg', 'SLANTRA', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770887721_5780.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770887721_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>SLANTRA &ndash; Geometrical FRP Planter</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Slantra planter is an elegant modern piece crafted with distinctive geometric aesthetics. Its sleek, slanted body and refined proportions make it a perfect choice for contemporary interiors and architectural landscapes. Designed using premium FRP, Slantra combines style, strength, and long-lasting durability.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Slantra planter stands out with:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A slanted geometric silhouette that adds depth and visual movement</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Clean, structured lines ideal for modern d&eacute;cor themes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A tall, slim profile that enhances the look of indoor plants and ornamental greens</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A sculptural design that acts as both a functional planter and a display element</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This unique shape makes Slantra an eye-catching feature for any premium space.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Slantra planters offer complete flexibility to match your project needs:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Available in multiple sizes to suit small, medium, and large spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom colors &amp; finishes including matte, gloss, stone, metallic, granule, and texture</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Option to match brand themes for commercial environments</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Suitable for both indoor &amp; outdoor customization</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Slantra FRP planter is ideal for:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Corporate offices, reception areas &amp; executive lounges</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern home interiors, balconies &amp; hallways</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotels, resorts, caf&eacute;s &amp; luxury commercial spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Terrace gardens, patios &amp; poolside arrangements</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Showrooms, malls, and architect-designed installations</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its contemporary form enhances spaces that demand a stylish, designer look.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Slantra?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Premium geometrical slanted design for upscale d&eacute;cor</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crafted from high-quality FRP, ensuring lightweight strength &amp; long-term durability</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">UV-resistant, corrosion-free &amp; weatherproof</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ideal for both interior styling and exterior landscaping</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Easy to maintain, fade-proof, and resistant to cracking</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Delivers a perfect balance of modern aesthetics &amp; functionality</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774439049_69c3ca893a763.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'SLANTRA', 'SLANTRA', 'SLANTRA', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:44:26'),
(45, 'AIRPORT-GH', NULL, NULL, 4, 'airport-gh', 'subsubcategories/1770888354.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770888354_4827.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770888354_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>AIRPORT GH – Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</h3><p>Elevate your landscape and architectural spaces with the AIRPORT GH FRP Planter, a timeless design inspired by classical urn silhouettes. Its refined curves, smooth vertical contouring, and elegant proportions make it a standout piece for premium décor applications.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The AIRPORT GH features a grand urn-inspired geometric form with a wide upper rim tapering gracefully toward the base. This classical silhouette brings a sense of heritage and luxury, perfectly suited for both modern and traditional spaces. Its gently ribbed texture adds depth and sophistication while maintaining a clean, sculptural look.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Multiple Sizes – from compact decorative units to tall statement pieces</li><li>Any Color Finish – matte, gloss, stone-effect, metallic, or dual-tone</li><li>Texture Options – ribbed, smooth, or premium patterned finish</li><li>Lightweight FRP Build – easy to move and highly durable</li></ul><p>We tailor every piece to complement your space seamlessly.</p><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Airports, hotels &amp; luxury lobbies</li><li>Resort entrances &amp; high-end outdoor lounges</li><li>Corporate offices and reception areas</li><li>Large balconies, terraces &amp; garden pathways</li><li>Villa entrances and premium residential projects</li></ul><p>Its tall, grand shape makes it ideal for showcasing decorative palms, ficus, bamboo, flowering plants, and indoor greens.</p><p>Why Choose AIRPORT GH?</p><ul><li>✔ Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical aesthetic for a luxurious architectural look</li><li>✔ FRP material ensures weather resistance, durability &amp; lightweight handling</li><li>✔ Low maintenance – won’t crack, fade, or deform</li><li>✔ Custom-made for décor professionals, architects, and landscape designers</li><li>✔ Perfect for creating high-impact visual statements</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:25:54'),
(46, 'ANDO', NULL, NULL, 4, 'ando', 'subsubcategories/1770888398.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770888398_1298.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770888398_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>ANDO – Imperial &amp; Neo Classical FRP Planter</h3><p>Bring home timeless elegance with the ANDO Planter, inspired by classic heritage pottery and crafted in premium FRP. With its intricate floral embossing and rounded imperial silhouette, ANDO adds a touch of old-world charm to any modern or traditional space.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The ANDO planter is defined by its rounded, pot-style silhouette paired with ornate floral carvings that create a distinguished neo-classical visual appeal.</p><ul><li>Wide, curved body ensures excellent soil depth</li><li>Thick rim adds structural strength and aesthetic contrast</li><li>Sculpted floral detailing enhances its artistry</li></ul><p>This shape is perfect for showcasing lush greens, flowering plants, and décor arrangements that demand a statement base.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Available in multiple sizes – from compact patio pots to grand entrance pieces</li><li>Custom colors &amp; finishes – matte, gloss, antique wash, stone texture, terracotta, marble finish &amp; more</li><li>Option to match décor themes for villas, resorts, hotels, gardens, lounges, and landscape projects</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Luxury gardens &amp; landscaped outdoor spaces</li><li>Villa entrances and porch décor</li><li>Hotel &amp; resort lobbies</li><li>Courtyards, patios, verandas</li><li>Classical interior themes &amp; heritage-style spaces</li><li>Medium to large ornamental plants, flowering bushes, ferns &amp; indoor foliage</li></ul><p>Its bold artistic look makes it a captivating centerpiece.</p><p>Why Choose the ANDO Planter?</p><ul><li>Premium FRP construction – lightweight, durable, weather-resistant</li><li>Elegant neo-classical design that elevates any space</li><li>Long-lasting craftsmanship with crack, fade &amp; rust resistance</li><li>Perfect blend of art + functionality</li><li>Customizable for residential &amp; commercial projects</li><li>Easy maintenance with superior finish quality</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:26:38'),
(47, 'ANGEL', NULL, NULL, 4, 'angel', 'subsubcategories/1770888438.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770888438_8062.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770888438_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>ANGLE – Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</h3><p>The ANGLE FRP Planter is a perfect blend of classical elegance and sculptural artistry. Inspired by traditional imperial urns, this planter features a beautifully contoured silhouette with carved floral detailing, making it an exquisite centerpiece for any premium landscape or architectural setting.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The ANGLE planter stands out with its wide flared rim, tapered mid-section, and an artistically embossed lower body. Its distinctive neo-classical profile adds a royal charm, while the structured base ensures stability. This shape is ideal for creating height, depth, and visual drama in both indoor and outdoor spaces.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Available in multiple sizes – from compact versions to large statement pieces</li><li>Wide color palette – classic white, antique stone, sandstone, terracotta, metallics, and more</li><li>Finish options – matte, glossy, textured, sandstone, marble-look, distressed classic</li><li>Custom embossing and detailing available on request</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Luxury villas, resorts, and heritage properties</li><li>Hotel lobbies, banquet entrances, and premium corridors</li><li>Garden pathways and outdoor landscapes</li><li>Large indoor plants like palms, ferns, ficus, and decorative shrubs</li><li>Accent installations in courtyards or classical architecture zones</li></ul><p>Why Choose the ANGLE FRP Planter?</p><ul><li>Lightweight yet extremely durable FRP construction</li><li>Weather-resistant – suitable for sun, rain, and moisture-rich environments</li><li>Retains its classic finish for years without fading</li><li>Adds a sophisticated imperial appeal instantly</li><li>Easy to move, maintain, and style</li></ul><p>The ANGLE planter brings a touch of majesty to any space, making it a preferred choice for architects, landscapers, and luxury property owners seeking timeless beauty with modern durability.</p>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:27:18'),
(48, 'ANS-GH', NULL, NULL, 4, 'ans-gh', 'subsubcategories/1770888484.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770888484_1836.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770888484_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>ANS GH – Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</h3><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The ANS GH planter features a timeless round imperial silhouette with a slightly tapered bottom and a wide, graceful rim. Its surface is beautifully adorned with intricate neo-classical carvings, including floral and geometric patterns inspired by traditional craftsmanship. This shape is ideal for adding richness, depth, and heritage appeal to any décor theme.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Colors: Available in classic earthy tones, metallic finishes, matte, glossy or antique textures</li><li>Sizes: Customizable heights and diameters to suit residential or commercial spaces</li><li>Patterns: Choose from plain, lightly textured, or ornate embossed designs</li><li>Drainage: Optional drainage holes</li><li>Branding: Logo engraving or custom motif work available for luxury projects</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Hotel lobbies &amp; luxury resort entrances</li><li>Heritage-themed interiors and courtyards</li><li>Villas, patios, and garden walkways</li><li>Temple surroundings &amp; cultural event spaces</li><li>Indoor statement corners with ornamental plants</li></ul><p>Perfect for showcasing palms, ficus, ferns, flowering plants, and decorative indoor greens that complement its grand design.</p><p>Why Choose ANS GH?</p><ul><li>Premium FRP construction – lightweight, durable, weather-resistant, and corrosion-free</li><li>Artisanal craftsmanship with attention to classical detailing</li><li>Elegance + functionality ideal for both décor enhancement and plant health</li><li>Low maintenance — easy to clean, fade-resistant, and long-lasting</li><li>Perfect for Luxury Projects — Adds a sophisticated, imperial touch to any environment</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:28:04'),
(49, 'BOTL', NULL, NULL, 4, 'botl', 'subsubcategories/1770888552.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770888552_1769.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770888552_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>BOTL</h3><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The BOTL shape brings a refined, elongated silhouette inspired by vintage bottle forms, perfect for adding a touch of sculptural elegance to any space. Its narrow, tall design makes it ideal for accentuating verticality while maintaining a sleek, minimalist aesthetic. The textured surface and gentle curves blend beautifully with both imperial and neo-classical interiors, making it a standout décor element.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes: Available in multiple height variations for tabletop, console, or floor placement.</li><li>Colors &amp; Finishes: Choose from matte, gloss, metallic, antique wash, stone, or custom luxury finishes.</li><li>Texture Patterns: Smooth, hammered, hand-carved, or classic embossed options.</li><li>Branding &amp; Embellishments: Custom motifs, logos, and engravings available on request.</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Enhancing luxury indoor décor, including living rooms, hotel lobbies, and office reception areas.</li><li>Displaying dried flowers, pampas grass, or minimal green stems.</li><li>Creating aesthetic clusters when paired in different heights or contrasting colors.</li><li>Perfect for narrow spaces, corners, side tables, or shelves where elegance is needed without occupying much width.</li></ul><p>Why Choose BOTL</p><ul><li>Unique sculptural presence that elevates any setting instantly.</li><li>Lightweight FRP construction ensures durability, weather resistance, and ease of handling.</li><li>Versatile styling—works equally well as a standalone art piece or with botanical arrangements.</li><li>Premium craftsmanship with intricate details suitable for upscale residences, hospitality projects, and designer-led interiors.</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:29:12'),
(50, 'CH-CUP', 'CH-CUP', 'CH-CUP', 4, 'ch-cup', 'subsubcategories/1770897460.png', 'CH-CUP', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770897461_3692.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770897461_5644.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770897461_breadcrumb.png', '<h3><strong>CH CUP &ndash; Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The CH CUP planter is inspired by classical chalice-style artistry, featuring a broad, elegant rim that narrows into a smooth, curved body. Its timeless silhouette reflects the grandeur of imperial design while maintaining a modern minimalistic touch. The shape naturally enhances plant volume and adds height, making it ideal for d&eacute;cor-focused spaces that demand sophistication.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Size Variations: Available in compact to tall formats to suit homes, hotels, lobbies, gardens, and commercial landscapes.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Palette: Matte, glossy, metallic, stone textures, sandstone, terracotta, wooden finish, and fully customized shades.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Surface Design: Smooth, embossed, patterned, or antique-carved options.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor/Outdoor Compatibility: Custom drainage, waterproof coating, and UV-stable finishing available.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ornamental plants, ferns, flowering bushes, and structured greens</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Enhancing neo-classical interiors, courtyard entrances, reception zones, verandas, and resort pathways</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Creating statement d&eacute;cor in villas, luxury hotels, heritage properties, and event spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for forming paired placements, grand entry points, and symmetrical d&eacute;cor arrangements</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose CH CUP</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Authentic imperial charm with a clean and polished FRP construction</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Lightweight yet highly durable, ensuring easy mobility and long-lasting performance</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Weather, moisture, and UV-resistant &mdash; suitable for any climate</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low maintenance with a premium handcrafted look</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Versatile styling that complements both modern and classical architecture</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774439191_69c3cb17069b0.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'CH-CUP', 'CH-CUP', 'CH-CUP', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:46:45'),
(51, 'EMPRE', 'EMPRE', 'EMPRE', 4, 'empre', 'subsubcategories/1770888691.jpg', 'EMPRE', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770888691_5435.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770888691_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>EMPRE &ndash; Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The EMPRE planter embodies the grandeur of classical empire-style design. With its tall, stately silhouette and refined contours, EMPRE brings a sense of aristocratic charm to any environment. Its gently widening body and clean taper lines create a harmonious balance between elegance and authority&mdash;perfect for spaces that demand a premium, royal aesthetic.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes Available: From slim-tall decorative pieces to large statement planters for lobbies and outdoor landscapes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish Choices: Matte, gloss, metallic gold/bronze, marble finish, sandstone texture, antique wash, and more</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Customization: Any RAL or bespoke shade to match interiors or brand identity</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Design Add-ons: Embossing, carving, detailing, or smooth minimalist styling</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Functional Upgrades:</span>\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Drainage customization</span></li>\r\n		<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">UV-resistant coating for outdoor use</span></li>\r\n		<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Waterproof inner lamination</span></li>\r\n		<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Lightweight or heavy-filled base options</span></li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Luxury hotels, palaces, heritage venues, premium homes, and corporate receptions</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Grand entrances, corridors, high-ceiling spaces, and symmetrical architectural layouts</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Tall ornamental plants, palm varieties, statement foliage, or structured d&eacute;cor greens</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Event styling, wedding d&eacute;cor, and landscape beautification where elegance is essential</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose EMPRE</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Imperial design that elevates any setting with timeless sophistication</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crafted in FRP, making it extremely durable yet surprisingly light</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Weatherproof, crack-resistant, and long-lasting&mdash;built for both indoor &amp; outdoor environments</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Offers versatile placements: corners, pathways, pillars, and centerpieces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Minimal maintenance with a premium handcrafted feel</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for creating a regal, high-end ambience</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774439287_69c3cb77321c9.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'EMPRE', 'EMPRE', 'EMPRE', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:48:20'),
(52, 'FUNL', NULL, NULL, 4, 'funl', 'subsubcategories/1770888731.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770888731_9653.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770888731_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>FUNL – Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</h3><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The FUNL planter features a graceful, funnel-inspired silhouette that widens toward the top, creating a striking visual balance between elegance and openness. Its smooth, tapering form is rooted in classical design principles, making it a perfect blend of imperial charm and modern refinement. The FUNL shape naturally draws the eye upward, enhancing the beauty of both plant and space.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Available Sizes: Small décor pieces to large architectural planters</li><li>Surface Finishes: Matte, glossy, stone-textured, metallic, antique, dual-tone, and marble-effect</li><li>Color Palette: Any RAL color or custom shade to match interiors or brand themes</li><li>Design Enhancements:<ul><li>Ornamental trims</li><li>Classic engraving or imperial motifs</li><li>Smooth minimalist look</li></ul></li><li>Functional Features:<ul><li>UV protection for outdoor use</li><li>Optional drainage outlets</li><li>Waterproof lining</li><li>Weighted base or lightweight body depending on placement</li></ul></li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Hotel lobbies, luxury residences, classical-themed villas, and landscaped courtyards</li><li>Indoor atriums, grand entrances, hallways, and balcony spaces</li><li>Tall plants, ornamental branches, structured greens, or premium artificial arrangements</li><li>Event setups, heritage décor, and high-end styling projects requiring a timeless aesthetic</li></ul><p>Why Choose FUNL</p><ul><li>Elegant imperial form that enhances classic and neo-classical architecture</li><li>Crafted in FRP, offering exceptional durability, light weight, and long-lasting performance</li><li>Weather-resistant, corrosion-free, and crack-proof, ideal for all climates</li><li>Versatile placement options—from tabletops to large statement edges</li><li>Low-maintenance with a premium handcrafted appeal</li><li>Adds a sophisticated, luxurious touch to both modern and heritage-inspired spaces</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:32:11'),
(53, 'G-GH', NULL, NULL, 4, 'g-gh', 'subsubcategories/1770888797.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770888797_9595.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770888797_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>G GH – Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</h3><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The G GH planter features a refined classical silhouette inspired by traditional imperial garden elements. With its gently rounded body, elevated base, and smooth architectural detailing, the G GH shape adds a sense of grandeur and symmetry to any space. Its balanced proportions make it an ideal centerpiece while maintaining timeless elegance that complements both classical and contemporary décor themes.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes Available: From compact indoor planters to large outdoor statement pieces</li><li>Finishes: Matte, gloss, stone-texture, antique wash, metallic tones, and marble-look</li><li>Color Customization: Full RAL color range or bespoke shades</li><li>Additional Enhancements:<ul><li>Decorative grooves or classical embossing</li><li>Dual-tone styling</li><li>Weighted or lightweight configuration</li><li>Drainage hole options</li></ul></li><li>Durability Features:<ul><li>UV-resistant coating</li><li>Weatherproof and corrosion-proof</li><li>Easy-to-clean surface</li></ul></li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Luxury hotel landscapes, grand entrances, heritage buildings, and premium residential projects</li><li>Indoor lobbies, corridors, verandas, balconies, and courtyards</li><li>Perfect for showcasing palms, ornamental shrubs, ficus varieties, flowering plants, or premium artificial arrangements</li><li>Ideal for creating symmetrical planter setups or focal points in classical-themed spaces</li></ul><p>Why Choose G GH</p><ul><li>A timeless imperial design that instantly elevates architectural aesthetics</li><li>Crafted from high-grade FRP, ensuring long life, lightweight handling, and unmatched durability</li><li>Resistant to cracks, rust, fading, and harsh weather conditions</li><li>Low-maintenance yet visually luxurious, making it suitable for both indoor and outdoor use</li><li>Customizable to blend seamlessly with any décor style or project theme</li><li>Enhances the overall look of spaces with its grand, sculptural appeal</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:33:17'),
(54, 'GH-TLEST', NULL, NULL, 4, 'gh-tlest', 'subsubcategories/1770888935.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770888935_4182.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770888935_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>GH TLEST – Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</h3><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The GH TLEST planter features a tall, elegant, and tapering classical silhouette that adds instant grandeur to any environment. Its elongated column-like body and refined contours create a striking vertical presence, perfect for enhancing entrances, corridors, and architectural pathways. The GH TLEST shape is designed to deliver a royal, neo-classical appeal while maintaining modern minimalism, making it ideal for premium interior and exterior styling.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Available Sizes: From medium-height indoor planters to tall outdoor statement models</li><li>Color Options: Choose from the full RAL palette, metallic shades, stone textures, antique gold/silver, or custom finishes</li><li>Surface Finishes: Gloss, matte, textured, marble-finish, or brushed metallic</li><li>Additional Custom Features:<ul><li>Weather-resistant coatings</li><li>Optional drainage holes</li><li>Weighted or lightweight versions</li><li>Embossed classical detailing</li></ul></li><li>Material Benefits:<ul><li>Crack-resistant FRP</li><li>UV-protected</li><li>Suitable for all weather conditions</li></ul></li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Luxury hotels, airports, malls, and corporate entrances</li><li>High-end residential foyers, stairways, verandas, and balconies</li><li>Ideal for tall plants like Areca palms, Dracaena, Bamboo, Ficus, or elegant ornamental arrangements</li><li>Perfect for creating symmetrical décor at gateways, lobbies, and reception zones</li></ul><p>Why Choose GH TLEST</p><ul><li>Distinctive tall neo-classical design that elevates both modern and traditional spaces</li><li>Built with premium FRP, ensuring durability, lightweight handling, and long-term performance</li><li>Completely weatherproof, rust-free, and fade-resistant</li><li>Enhances spatial height and visual drama with its sculpted vertical form</li><li>Fully customizable to match architectural themes, color palettes, and project specifications</li><li>Ideal for designers, architects, landscapers, and property owners seeking a luxurious yet low-maintenance planter</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:35:35'),
(55, 'JP-GH', NULL, NULL, 4, 'jp-gh', 'subsubcategories/1770888972.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770888972_2922.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770888972_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>JP GH – Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</h3><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The JP GH planter is designed with a graceful, elongated neo-classical silhouette that blends traditional charm with modern refinement. Its gently flared top, smooth contours, and symmetrical form make it a timeless decorative element. The JP GH shape is ideal for creating balance and visual harmony in luxury interiors and grand exterior landscapes, offering a sophisticated presence that elevates any setting.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes Available: Multiple height and width variations to suit indoor and outdoor décor</li><li>Color Palette: Entire RAL range, antique bronze, gold, silver, rustic textures, matte stone, gloss, or marble finish</li><li>Finish Options: Smooth matte, high-gloss, textured stone, brushed metallic</li><li>Additional Custom Features:<br>o Drainage hole options<br>o UV-resistant and weatherproof coating<br>o Custom embossing or detailing<br>o Lightweight OR weighted base options</li><li>Material Advantages:<br>o Durable FRP body<br>o Crack-proof &amp; rust-free<br>o Fade-resistant even under harsh conditions</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Luxury homes, premium hotels, resorts, and high-end commercial interiors</li><li>Entrances, lobby corners, hallways, verandas, terraces, and landscaped gardens</li><li>Pairs beautifully with tall plants like Song of India, Fiddle Leaf Fig, Bamboo Palm, Dracaena, and flowering arrangements</li><li>Perfect for creating symmetrical décor at doorways, pathways, and architectural pillars</li></ul><p>Why Choose JP GH</p><ul><li>Its classic, flared neo-classical design adds elegance to any environment</li><li>Completely customizable, making it suitable for both modern and vintage décor styles</li><li>Built using superior FRP, ensuring long-lasting performance with minimal maintenance</li><li>Lightweight yet sturdy, making installation easy across residential and commercial spaces</li><li>Enhances visual impact with its sculpted silhouette and premium finishing options</li><li>Ideal for architects, landscape designers, and homeowners seeking luxurious FRP planters that combine durability with style</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:36:12'),
(56, 'KC-GH', NULL, NULL, 4, 'kc-gh', 'subsubcategories/1770889014.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889014_9421.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889014_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>KC GH – Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</h3><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The KC GH planter features a distinguished classic urn-inspired silhouette with smooth curves, a subtly raised pedestal base, and a refined imperial profile. Its design blends grandeur with minimalism, making it a standout centerpiece in luxury interiors and landscaped exteriors. The KC GH shape is crafted to enhance symmetry, elevate plant height visually, and add timeless elegance to any architectural setting.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Available Sizes: From compact decorative pieces to tall statement models</li><li>Color Choices: Complete RAL shade selection, antique gold, white marble finish, brushed metallic, matte stone shades, and high-gloss premium colors</li><li>Finish Options: Smooth matte, gloss, textured stone, ceramic look</li><li>Additional Custom Features:<br>o Optional drainage system<br>o UV-resistant coat for outdoor durability<br>o Custom design embossing or surface patterns<br>o Lightweight or weighted bottom</li><li>Material Qualities:<br>o Weatherproof and fade-resistant FRP<br>o Non-corrosive, crack-proof, and easy to maintain</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Luxury villa entrances, balcony corners, hotel lobbies, banquet halls, and heritage-style architecture</li><li>Enhances symmetry in corridors, reception areas, verandas, and column-lined walkways</li><li>Perfect for plants like Areca Palm, Rubber Plant, Ficus, Peace Lily, and ornamental flowering plants</li><li>Great for creating a premium aesthetic in residential, corporate, and hospitality spaces</li></ul><p>Why Choose KC GH</p><ul><li>Designed with a classic neo-classical profile that elevates décor effortlessly</li><li>Adds timeless sophistication while complementing modern or traditional settings</li><li>Highly customizable to match architectural themes and designer requirements</li><li>Built from premium FRP, offering longevity, strength, and lightweight handling</li><li>Ideal for homeowners, architects, and landscapers seeking decorative yet durable luxury planters</li><li>Makes a strong visual statement with its royal form and refined details</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:36:54'),
(57, 'KOCH', 'KOCH', 'KOCH', 4, 'koch', 'subsubcategories/1770889191.jpg', 'KOCH', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889191_8369.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770889191_3100.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889191_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>KOCH &ndash; Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The KOCH planter is designed with a sophisticated tapered classical bowl silhouette combined with an elevated base, giving it a regal and sculptural appeal. Its balanced curves and proportionate depth make it ideal for premium landscaping and interior d&eacute;cor. The KOCH shape reflects timeless neo-classical artistry, creating a harmonious blend of luxury and architectural finesse.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes Available: Multiple diameters and heights to suit entrances, corridors, balconies, and large landscaped areas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Options: Choose from RAL colors, antique finishes, marble textures, metallic gold/silver, matte stone, and high-gloss premium shades</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish Customization: Textured stone finish, smooth matte, gloss, ceramic look, or handcrafted antique detailing</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Additional Features:<br />\r\n	o UV-resistant outdoor coating<br />\r\n	o Optional drainage provision<br />\r\n	o Weatherproof FRP body<br />\r\n	o Lightweight yet durable construction<br />\r\n	o Weighted base option for high-footfall areas</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Luxury hotel lobbies, premium villa entrances, banquet hall d&eacute;cor, and landscaped gardens</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Enhances spaces like reception areas, verandas, corridors, terraces, and heritage-inspired architectural environments</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for ornamental plants like Fiddle Leaf Fig, Areca Palm, Dracaena, Aglaonema, Bonsai varieties, and seasonal flowering plants</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ideal for creating paired symmetry at gates, pathways, or inside classical-style interiors</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose KOCH</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Showcases a timeless imperial aesthetic that elevates any d&eacute;cor style</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Fully customizable to complement your architectural theme and designer requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crafted from high-quality FRP, making it long-lasting, lightweight, weather-resistant, and easy to maintain</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Adds a sense of luxury and grandeur without overwhelming the space</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A perfect choice for designers, architects, and homeowners seeking premium classical planter designs</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774439445_69c3cc15b4d8f.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'KOCH', 'KOCH', 'KOCH', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:50:57'),
(58, 'KRISH', NULL, NULL, 4, 'krish', 'subsubcategories/1770889172.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889172_6117.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889172_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>KRISH – Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP Planter</h3><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The KRISH planter is designed with a refined tall, elegant pedestal silhouette, inspired by imperial-era architecture. Its elongated body, subtle curves, and elevated stand give it a majestic presence—perfect for creating height, symmetry, and grandeur in premium spaces. The KRISH shape blends classical artistry with modern durability, making it an exceptional décor element for upscale landscapes and interiors.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Available Sizes: Multiple height and diameter configurations to suit entrances, corridors, balconies, and lawn décor</li><li>Color Palette: Custom RAL shades, textured stone finishes, brushed metallic tones, antique gold/silver, and smooth matte/gloss variants</li><li>Finish Enhancements:<br>o Stone-effect finish<br>o Marble-look coating<br>o Hand-polished antique detailing<br>o Glossy ceramic-like finish</li><li>Additional Features:<br>o UV-resistant outdoor-safe coating<br>o Optional drainage holes<br>o Weatherproof FRP construction<br>o Lightweight with optional weighted base</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Luxury hotel entrances, banquet halls, villa patios, temple courtyards, and heritage-inspired interiors</li><li>Ideal for plant types like Areca Palm, Ficus, Snake Plant, Dracaena, Syngonium, and seasonal flowering arrangements</li><li>Creates stunning paired entrance décor, pathway accents, balcony highlights, and indoor focal points</li><li>Enhances classical and neo-classical design themes with its majestic vertical profile</li></ul><p>Why Choose KRISH</p><ul><li>Offers a stately and elegant design that instantly elevates any space</li><li>Customizable to match any décor palette, architectural style, or design theme</li><li>Made from premium FRP—lightweight, durable, weather-resistant, and easy to maintain</li><li>Perfect for creating height variation in interior or exterior landscaping</li><li>Trusted by architects and designers for achieving a luxurious heritage look with modern durability</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:39:32'),
(59, 'MAHA- RJ', NULL, NULL, 4, 'maha-rj', 'subsubcategories/1770889221.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889221_7844.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889221_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>Maha RJ – Grandeur Rooted in Tradition</h3><p>The Maha RJ planter is a signature piece in our Imperial &amp; Neo-Classical FRP collection—where royal elegance meets timeless craftsmanship. Designed with a majestic silhouette and detailed contours, this planter instantly elevates any space with a touch of heritage-inspired luxury.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The Maha RJ shape features:</p><ul><li>A grand, regal profile inspired by classical Indian royal architecture</li><li>Smooth curves with structured edges for an opulent yet balanced form</li><li>High-strength FRP construction that ensures lightweight handling with long-lasting durability</li><li>A design that stands out as a statement décor element both indoors and outdoors</li></ul><p>Customization Options</p><p>Tailor the Maha RJ planter to match your style:</p><ul><li>Sizes: Available in multiple height and width options to suit homes, hotels, offices, and landscape projects</li><li>Colors &amp; Finishes: Matte, gloss, stone-texture, metallics, antique wash, and wood-tone finishes</li><li>Branding: Custom engraving or logo placement for luxury villas, hospitality chains, and corporate spaces</li><li>Plant Compatibility: Adaptable depth and width for ornamental plants, palms, bonsai, or flowering varieties</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><p>The Maha RJ planter adds a premium aesthetic to:</p><ul><li>Hotel lobbies &amp; luxury resorts</li><li>Heritage-themed interiors</li><li>Corporate reception areas</li><li>High-end residential entrances, balconies, and terraces</li><li>Boutique stores and showrooms</li><li>Landscape walkways and courtyard highlights</li></ul><p>Why Choose Maha RJ?</p><ul><li>Timeless Aesthetic: A royal-inspired shape that never goes out of style</li><li>Lightweight &amp; Durable: FRP material ensures easy movement without compromising strength</li><li>Weatherproof: UV-resistant, corrosion-free, and perfect for all climates</li><li>Premium Craftsmanship: Hand-finished details that enhance its visual richness</li><li>Versatile Usage: Complements both modern minimal spaces and traditional luxury décor</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:40:21'),
(60, 'SIPA', 'SIPA', 'SIPA', 4, 'sipa', 'subsubcategories/1770889508.jpg', 'SIPA', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889508_6042.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770889508_1498.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889508_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>SIPA &ndash; The Perfect Blend of Elegance &amp; Simplicity</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The SIPA planter is a classic design that brings understated luxury to any environment. Crafted in premium-grade FRP, this shape is known for its clean lines, balanced proportions, and timeless aesthetic&mdash;making it a versatile choice for both modern and heritage-inspired spaces.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A refined, symmetrical silhouette that adds quiet sophistication</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Smooth, seamless edges that complement both bold and minimal d&eacute;cor themes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Lightweight yet durable FRP construction, ideal for easy placement and long-term use</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A universally appealing form that enhances visual harmony in interiors and landscapes</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Size Variants: Multiple height and diameter options suitable for small indoor settings to large outdoor installations</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Palette: Choose from matte, gloss, metallic, stone-texture, or custom RAL colors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Surface Finish Options: Smooth, textured, antique wash, or marble effect</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Plant Compatibility: Accommodates ornamental plants, bonsai, palms, and flowering arrangements</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Additional Features: Optional drainage holes, weighted base for stability, UV-resistant coating for outdoor durability</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Luxury residences, offices, lobbies, and boutique stores</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Balconies, terraces, verandas, and landscaped walkways</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Creates focal points in garden settings or complements symmetry in hallways and reception areas</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose SIPA</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Timeless design that fits seamlessly into any d&eacute;cor</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customizable finishes to match personal or project aesthetics</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Durable and lightweight FRP material ensures longevity and easy maintenance</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for designers, landscapers, and homeowners seeking elegance with simplicity</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774439600_69c3ccb0c0164.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'SIPA', 'SIPA', 'SIPA', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:53:31');
INSERT INTO `sub_sub_categories` (`id`, `name`, `bread_heading`, `bread_subheading`, `subcategory_id`, `slug`, `image`, `alt`, `multi_images`, `breadimage`, `description`, `long_desc`, `sort`, `status`, `metatag`, `metadescription`, `metakeywords`, `metatags`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(61, 'STR', NULL, NULL, 4, 'str', 'subsubcategories/1770889539.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889539_5276.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889539_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>STR – Sleek &amp; Refined FRP Planter</h3><p>The STR planter embodies modern elegance with a subtle neo-classical influence. Its sleek profile and smooth, rounded edges make it ideal for contemporary interiors and landscaped outdoor spaces. Crafted in durable FRP, STR offers both style and functionality.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><ul><li>Sleek, elongated silhouette for vertical emphasis</li><li>Rounded edges for a smooth, minimalist appearance</li><li>Lightweight FRP construction with high durability</li></ul><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes: Various heights and diameters to suit indoor and outdoor needs</li><li>Finishes: Matte, gloss, textured stone, metallic, marble-effect</li><li>Additional Features: Optional drainage holes, weighted or lightweight versions, UV-resistant coating</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Luxury lobbies, office spaces, balconies, terraces</li><li>Modern gardens, pathways, and reception areas</li><li>Perfect for ornamental plants, palms, or flowering arrangements</li></ul><p>Why Choose STR</p><ul><li>Combines durability with a sleek, contemporary design</li><li>Fully customizable to fit aesthetic requirements</li><li>Lightweight yet strong, suitable for all indoor and outdoor environments</li><li>Elevates the visual appeal of any setting with minimal effort</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:45:39'),
(62, 'TULSI', NULL, NULL, 4, 'tulsi', 'subsubcategories/1770889669.webp', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889669_7340.webp\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889669_breadcrumb.webp', '<h3>TULSI – Traditional &amp; Timeless FRP Planter</h3><p>The TULSI planter blends traditional elegance with modern materials. Its well-balanced design and classical contours make it a versatile choice for homes, temples, gardens, and premium landscapes. Crafted in high-quality FRP, it offers durability, weather-resistance, and low maintenance.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><ul><li>Traditional rounded base with refined upper contours</li><li>Elegant silhouette suitable for both indoor and outdoor spaces</li><li>Durable FRP construction for long-term use</li></ul><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes: Multiple height and diameter options for various planting needs</li><li>Color &amp; Finish: Matte, gloss, metallic, stone-texture, marble-effect, or custom RAL colors</li><li>Additional Features: Optional drainage holes, weighted base, UV-resistant coating</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Homes, temples, offices, lobbies, and balconies</li><li>Enhancing garden aesthetics and landscape symmetry</li><li>Ideal for tulsi plants, ornamental greenery, and flowering arrangements</li></ul><p>Why Choose TULSI</p><ul><li>Combines tradition with modern FRP durability</li><li>Lightweight and easy to place without compromising on elegance</li><li>Fully customizable to match décor style and project requirements</li><li>Weatherproof, UV-resistant, and low-maintenance for long-lasting use</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:47:49'),
(63, 'BAM-CYL', NULL, NULL, 5, 'bam-cyl', 'subsubcategories/1770889793.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889793_1837.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770889793_4802.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889793_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>BAM CYL – Bamboo-Inspired Cylindrical FRP Planter</h3><p>The BAM CYL planter draws inspiration from the natural elegance of bamboo, blending organic texture with a sleek cylindrical silhouette. Designed to bring the serenity of nature into modern and traditional spaces, this planter captures the charm of bamboo while offering the durability of FRP.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><ul><li>Bamboo-Textured Detailing: Realistic grooves and patterns that mimic natural bamboo</li><li>Cylindrical Form: Smooth, vertical structure that enhances height and visual harmony</li><li>Nature-Inspired Aesthetic: Ideal for adding an eco-friendly, earthy vibe to any setting</li><li>Durable FRP Build: Lightweight, weather-resistant, and long-lasting</li></ul><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Size Options: Available in multiple diameters and heights</li><li>Colors &amp; Finishes: Natural bamboo shades, wood textures, matte, glossy, dual-tone, or custom colors</li><li>Textural Variations: Fine, medium, or bold bamboo ribbed texture</li><li>Interior/Exterior Coating: For enhanced longevity depending on usage</li><li>Branding: Custom engravings or logo impressions available on request</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Resort landscapes and nature-themed interiors</li><li>Balcony gardens, patios, and terraces</li><li>Indoor plant corners &amp; lobby décor</li><li>Commercial spaces such as cafés, spas, wellness studios, and eco-themed outlets</li><li>Walkways, entrances, and corridors</li><li>Projects focusing on nature-inspired, biophilic design</li></ul><p>Why Choose BAM CYL?</p><ul><li>Brings Nature Indoors: Creates a calming, earthy aesthetic with bamboo-inspired texture</li><li>Highly Durable: FRP construction ensures resistance to moisture, UV rays, and cracks</li><li>Lightweight &amp; Easy to Place: Convenient to move even in larger sizes</li><li>Versatile Styling: Complements rustic, contemporary, tropical, and minimal décor themes</li><li>Low Maintenance: Requires no polishing or seasonal upkeep unlike natural bamboo</li><li>Long-Lasting Finish: Color and texture remain intact even in outdoor environments</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:49:53'),
(64, 'BAM-TOK', 'BAM-TOK', 'BAM-TOK', 5, 'bam-tok', 'subsubcategories/1770889784.jpg', 'BAM-TOK', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889784_7684.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889784_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>BAM TOK &ndash; Bamboo-Inspired Tapered FRP Planter</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The BAM TOK planter beautifully merges the raw charm of bamboo with a refined, modern tapered silhouette. Designed for spaces that seek a blend of nature, sophistication, and architectural balance, BAM TOK stands out with its unique texture and elegant, narrow form.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Tapered Bamboo Structure: A distinctive narrowing form that adds height and visual depth</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Natural Bamboo Groove Texture: Realistic bamboo-inspired ribbing for an earthy look</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Elegant, Minimal Profile: Perfect for creating clean lines in both indoor and outdoor setups</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">FRP Strength: Lightweight yet sturdy, resistant to weather, moisture, and cracking</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes: Various heights and base diameters to match residential or commercial requirements</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Colors &amp; Finishes: Bamboo-natural tones, wood-textured shades, matte, glossy, or dual-tone finishes</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Texture Depth: Light, medium, or bold bamboo ribbed detailing</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Coatings: Indoor-friendly, outdoor UV-protected, or waterproof coatings</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Branding: Custom engraving, patterns, or project-specific color palettes</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotels, resorts, spas, and wellness retreats</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Biophilic and nature-themed interiors</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Balcony gardens, terrace green corners, and patios</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Entryways, lobby d&eacute;cor, and reception areas</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Walkways and landscaped pathways</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Restaurants, caf&eacute;s, and boutique spaces aiming for a natural aesthetic</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose BAM TOK?</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect Blend of Nature &amp; Design: Bamboo texture with modern tapered elegance</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">High Durability: FRP ensures long life with no cracking, swelling, or fading</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Lightweight &amp; Easy to Move: Even in large sizes, relocation is simple</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Versatile Style Fit: Complements rustic, tropical, contemporary, earthy, and luxury interiors</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low Maintenance: No polishing or special treatments required</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Eco-Vibe Appeal: Enhances any space aiming for a sustainable, nature-inspired ambience</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Bamboo Inspired Tapered FRP Planter', 'Looking for a Bamboo Inspired Tapered FRP Planter at the best contact us at Yuccabeplanters and get the best price', 'BAM-TOK, Bamboo-Inspired Tapered FRP Planter', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-06 17:36:59'),
(65, 'HY-TOK', NULL, NULL, 5, 'hy-tok', 'subsubcategories/1770889959.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889959_2435.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770889959_7974.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889959_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>HY TOK – Nature-Inspired Hybrid Taper FRP Planter</h3><p>The HY TOK planter brings together organic aesthetics and modern geometry, creating a hybrid tapered form inspired by natural textures. Designed for both luxurious and earthy environments, HY TOK adds elegance, height, and a natural statement to any space.</p><p>Shape pecialization</p><ul><li>Hybrid Tapered Design: A smooth narrowing profile that adds height and modern balance</li><li>Organic Surface Texture: Inspired by natural elements for an earthy and authentic look</li><li>Sleek Vertical Flow: Enhances plant height and makes it perfect for tall greens</li><li>FRP Durability: Strong, lightweight, and resistant to moisture, UV rays, and corrosion</li></ul><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Available Sizes: Multiple heights and diameters for indoor and outdoor applications</li><li>Finish Options: Matte, gloss, natural stone, earthy textures, or custom effects</li><li>Color Choices: Wood-inspired tones, greens, naturals, black, white, or any custom shade</li><li>Texture Variants: Fine, medium, or bold organic patterning</li><li>Brand Customization: Logo engraving, theme color matching, or project-specific finishes</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Luxury villas, premium homes, resorts, and boutique hotels</li><li>Biophilic interiors and nature-themed décor spaces</li><li>Entrance foyers, lobby corners, and reception areas</li><li>Balconies, terraces, patios, and open green spaces</li><li>Restaurants, cafés, and lifestyle stores</li><li>Pathways, landscaping zones, and curated garden spots</li></ul><p>Why Choose HY TOK?</p><ul><li>Nature Meets Modern Design: Elegant tapered form with natural-inspired texture</li><li>Highly Durable Material: FRP ensures long-lasting performance without cracking or fading</li><li>Lightweight Construction: Easily portable even in large sizes</li><li>Timeless Aesthetic: Blends seamlessly with rustic, tropical, modern, and minimal interior themes</li><li>Low Maintenance: Weather-resistant, easy to clean, and suitable for all climates</li><li>Customizable: Perfect for matching any architectural or landscape theme</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:52:39'),
(66, 'RS-TOK', NULL, NULL, 5, 'rs-tok', 'subsubcategories/1770889955.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770889955_7560.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770889955_2197.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770889955_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>RS TOK – Rustic Tapered FRP Planter Inspired by Natural Textures</h3><p>The RS TOK planter brings the beauty of raw nature into modern spaces. Designed with a rustic, naturally-inspired vertical texture and a sleek tapered form, this planter adds character, warmth, and depth to any interior or landscape project. Its FRP construction ensures strength, durability, and long-term performance.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><ul><li>Rustic Vertical Texture: Mimics natural wood, bark, or stone-inspired patterns</li><li>Elegant Tapered Silhouette: Wider at the top, narrowing downward for a refined, stylish look</li><li>Organic Aesthetic: Perfect for natural, earthy, and biophilic design themes</li><li>Lightweight FRP Build: Strong yet easy to reposition across different spaces</li></ul><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes Available: Short, mid-height, and tall variations for layering or statement displays</li><li>Color Choices: Rustic browns, natural greys, charcoal, earthy greens, matte whites, or any custom color</li><li>Finish Options: Matte, textured, stone-finish, or natural wood-effect</li><li>Special Customization: Logo branding, project-specific patterns, and theme-based color matching</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Nature-inspired resorts, villas, and luxury homestays</li><li>Biophilic interiors, earthy cafés, and boutique hotels</li><li>Balcony gardens, patios, and verandas</li><li>Landscape walkways, garden corners, and open green spaces</li><li>Reception areas, lobbies, and architectural entrances</li><li>Meditation zones, spas, and wellness spaces</li></ul><p>Why Choose RS TOK?</p><ul><li>Perfect Blend of Rustic &amp; Modern: Natural texture with a clean tapered profile</li><li>Durable FRP Construction: Weatherproof, UV-resistant, and long-lasting</li><li>Lightweight &amp; Portable: Easy to move, even in larger sizes</li><li>Low Maintenance: Doesn’t crack, fade, or corrode</li><li>Enhances Greenery: Its earthy texture beautifully highlights indoor and outdoor plants</li><li>Fully Customizable: Designed to suit residential, commercial, and landscape projects</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:52:35'),
(67, 'blub', NULL, NULL, 6, 'blub', 'subsubcategories/1770890184.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770890184_1181.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770890184_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>BLUB – Contemporary Bulb-Shaped FRP Planter with Smooth Tapered Elegance</h3><p>The BLUB planter is a modern interpretation of the classic bulb silhouette. Its smooth, rounded upper body paired with a gently tapered base creates a graceful, sculptural presence ideal for premium interior and exterior styling. Designed using high-quality FRP, it offers exceptional durability while maintaining a luxurious aesthetic.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The BLUB planter stands out for:</p><ul><li>Bulb-Inspired Rounded Form: A full, soft dome shape at the top for visual balance and high design impact</li><li>Tapered Lower Section: Ensures stability while creating a modern, streamlined look</li><li>Seamless Curves: Adds elegance and fluidity, perfect for contemporary design themes</li><li>Cylindrical–Tapered Fusion: Offers excellent versatility for a variety of plant sizes and décor settings</li></ul><p>Customization Options</p><p>Tailor the BLUB planter to suit any residential, commercial, or landscaping project:</p><ul><li>Size Variants: Available in compact, medium, and large formats</li><li>Color Customization: Glossy, matte, metallic, pastel, or corporate color matching</li><li>Surface Finish Options: Smooth, textured, stone-effect, satin, or high-gloss</li><li>Additional Personalization: Branding, theme-based palette, and bespoke height adjustments</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><p>The BLUB planter is ideal for:</p><ul><li>Modern lobbies and reception areas</li><li>High-end homes, penthouses, and living room corners</li><li>Luxury hotels, resorts, and boutique showrooms</li><li>Office entrances, corporate spaces, and atriums</li><li>Balcony gardens, terraces, and semi-outdoor lounges</li><li>Statement plant displays using palms, dracaenas, ficus, or ornamental greens</li></ul><p>Why Choose BLUB?</p><ul><li>Designer Silhouette: Unique bulb-like design enhances any architectural setting</li><li>Premium FRP Build: Lightweight yet strong, UV-resistant, and weatherproof</li><li>Versatile Placement: Complements minimalist, contemporary, and luxury décor themes</li><li>Low Maintenance: Does not crack, fade, or corrode over time</li><li>High Aesthetic Value: Smooth curves and elegant proportions elevate plant styling</li><li>Fully Customizable: Perfect for interior designers, architects, and landscape planners</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 16:56:24'),
(68, 'CAPSU', NULL, NULL, 6, 'capsu', 'subsubcategories/1770890401.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770890401_7731.png\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770890401_4294.png\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770890401_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>CAPSU – Sleek Capsule-Shaped FRP Planter for Modern Interior &amp; Exterior Styling</h3><p>The CAPSU planter is inspired by the smooth, elongated form of a capsule—offering a perfect blend of minimalism and elegance. Its soft edges, rounded silhouette, and seamless curves make it a versatile décor element suited for luxury residential and commercial spaces. Crafted in premium FRP, CAPSU brings long-lasting strength with a contemporary designer look.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The CAPSU planter features:</p><ul><li>Capsule-Inspired Geometry: A long, oval cylindrical body with rounded ends</li><li>Soft, Seamless Curves: Adds a sophisticated, fluid appearance to any setting</li><li>Balanced Proportions: Ensures stability and visual harmony</li><li>Taper-Friendly Design: Works beautifully in both vertical and horizontal styling concepts</li></ul><p>This shape is excellent for creating flow, symmetry, and modern spatial continuity.</p><p>Customization Options</p><p>The CAPSU planter can be customized to meet diverse design requirements:</p><ul><li>Available Sizes: Compact, medium, large, and oversized options</li><li>Color Selection: Matte, glossy, satin, metallic, stone-effect, or custom brand colors</li><li>Finish Variations: Smooth finish, textured patterns, or stone-feel surfaces</li><li>Additional Customization: Height adjustment, custom width, logo branding, and theme-based color matching</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><p>CAPSU is an ideal choice for:</p><ul><li>Modern home entrances, balconies, and living rooms</li><li>Premium office spaces, corridors, and reception lounges</li><li>Hotels, luxury resorts, and spa environments</li><li>Walkways, pool decks, and terrace gardens</li><li>Indoor plants like ZZ, Snake Plant, Aglaonema &amp; large palms</li><li>Outdoor landscaping with symmetrical plant arrangements</li></ul><p>Its sleek shape enhances minimalist, contemporary, Scandinavian, and urban design styles.</p><p>Why Choose CAPSU?</p><ul><li>Modern Capsule Design: Adds style, symmetry, and softness to any space</li><li>Premium FRP Construction: Lightweight, durable, weather-resistant, and crack-free</li><li>Designer Aesthetic: Perfect for architects and interior stylists</li><li>Low Maintenance: Easy to clean and built to withstand indoor and outdoor conditions</li><li>Highly Versatile: Complements tall greens, decorative plants, and cluster arrangements</li><li>Fully Customizable: Tailored to project themes and brand personalities</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:00:01'),
(69, 'CILIN', NULL, NULL, 6, 'cilin', 'subsubcategories/1770890414.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770890414_8220.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770890414_2742.png\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770890414_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>CILIN – Classic Cylindrical FRP Planter for Timeless Vertical Elegance</h3><p>CILIN is a refined cylindrical FRP planter designed to bring clean lines, vertical balance, and modern simplicity to any space. Its perfectly rounded structure makes it one of the most versatile shapes in premium landscaping and interior décor. Strong, lightweight, and crafted with precision, the CILIN planter is a favorite among architects and designers for both indoor and outdoor styling.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The CILIN planter is defined by:</p><ul><li>Pure Cylindrical Form: Uniform round structure offering perfect symmetry</li><li>Vertical Height Options: Ideal for creating tall, elegant plant displays</li><li>Smooth Curvature: Enhances minimalistic and contemporary design elements</li><li>Taper-Free Body: Ensures maximum internal volume for plant growth</li></ul><p>This shape is excellent for adding vertical definition and architectural harmony to any environment.</p><p>Customization Options</p><p>The CILIN planter can be tailored to suit any project requirement:</p><ul><li>Sizes: Small, medium, tall, jumbo, and custom heights</li><li>Colors: Matte, glossy, satin, metallic, stone-texture, terrazzo finish, or custom RAL shades</li><li>Finishes: Smooth FRP, textured surface, stone-effect, or brushed metallic</li><li>Additional Options: Branding, theme-based color matching, and custom proportions</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><p>CILIN excels in:</p><ul><li>Residential living rooms, balconies, and entrances</li><li>Premium commercial areas—lobbies, corridors, office corners, and reception zones</li><li>Hotel, resort, and café décor concepts</li><li>Outdoor spaces like terraces, pool decks, patios, and walkways</li><li>Tall plant species such as Areca Palm, Bamboo, Dracaena, Ficus, and Snake Plants</li><li>Cluster arrangements in varying heights for a layered luxury look</li></ul><p>Its cylindrical form complements modern, industrial, contemporary, and minimalistic interiors.</p><p>Why Choose CILIN?</p><ul><li>Timeless Cylindrical Design: Works universally across décor themes</li><li>Premium FRP Build: Lightweight, strong, weather-proof, and long-lasting</li><li>Elegant Vertical Aesthetic: Perfect for enhancing height and space dynamics</li><li>Versatile Placement: Suitable for both compact and large spaces</li><li>Low Maintenance: Easy to clean, fade-resistant, and durable in all climates</li><li>Highly Customizable: Made to fit your design vision and project specifications</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:00:14'),
(70, 'd cut', 'D-Cut Shape', 'D-Cut Shape', 6, 'd-cut', 'subsubcategories/1770891650.jpg', 'D-Cut Shape', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770891650_5563.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770891650_2383.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770891650_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>D-Cut Shape</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The D-Cut planter is designed with a flat back and a smooth curved front, forming a sleek &quot;D&quot; shape. This smart geometry allows it to fit seamlessly against walls, railings, partitions, and tight corners while maintaining a modern, aesthetic appearance. Its streamlined profile makes it ideal for areas where space optimization and visual elegance are equally important.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes: Available in compact to large dimensions for indoor and outdoor use</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Colors &amp; Finishes: Matte, gloss, stone, metallic, wooden finish, and premium custom colors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Textures: Smooth, ribbed, grain, sandstone and luxury textures</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Add-ons: Drip trays, internal lining, drainage holes (optional), branding/logo placement</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Usage Flexibility: Suitable for natural plants, artificial plants, and hydroponic setups</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Balcony railings and verandas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office corridors and reception areas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Residential living room corners</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Restaurants, cafes, and boutique entrances</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Wall-aligned gardens and narrow pathways</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern interior d&eacute;cor that demands minimal space usage</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose the D-Cut FRP Planter?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Space-Saving Design: Perfect for wall-side placement without compromising aesthetics</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Lightweight &amp; Durable: FRP makes it easy to move while ensuring long-lasting strength</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Weather-Resistant: UV-stable, corrosion-free, and suitable for indoor/outdoor climates</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Elegantly Minimal: Enhances d&eacute;cor with its contemporary, clean-line silhouette</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Highly Customisable: Designed to match your theme, space, and plant requirements</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774439831_69c3cd97e4f3e.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'D-Cut Shape', 'D-Cut Shape', 'D-Cut Shape', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:57:21'),
(71, 'DMD', NULL, NULL, 6, 'dmd', 'subsubcategories/1770891815.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770891954_4346.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770891954_4418.png\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770891954_8961.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770891815_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>DMT Shape</h3><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The DMT planter shape is crafted with a modern geometric form that combines depth, sleek tapered lines, and a balanced silhouette. Its structured design adds a contemporary architectural appeal, making it ideal for both minimalistic and luxurious décor themes. The DMT shape offers excellent stability while maintaining a refined, stylish presence in any space.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes: Multiple height and width variations to suit residential, commercial, and landscaping needs</li><li>Colors &amp; Finishes: Matte, gloss, concrete finish, stone finish, metallic, and custom premium colors</li><li>Textures: Smooth, grain, ribbed, sandstone, terrazzo-inspired textures</li><li>Add-Ons: Optional drainage holes, drip trays, internal lining, lightweight soil-fill inserts</li><li>Branding: Custom logo engraving or printing available for hospitality and corporate spaces</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Hotel lobbies and premium commercial interiors</li><li>Luxury balconies and terrace gardens</li><li>Office entrances, boardrooms, and corridors</li><li>Villa and apartment living spaces</li><li>Restaurant and café décor</li><li>Landscape architecture and outdoor walkways</li></ul><p>Why Choose the DMT FRP Planter?</p><ul><li>Contemporary Aesthetic: Adds a bold, modern edge to any environment</li><li>Lightweight &amp; Durable: FRP construction ensures easy handling with long-lasting performance</li><li>Weatherproof Design: UV-resistant, corrosion-free, and suitable for all climates</li><li>High Stability: The tapered geometry provides excellent strength and balance</li><li>Fully Customizable: Designed to match your project theme, plant type, and overall ambience</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:25:54'),
(72, 'DRACO', NULL, NULL, 6, 'draco', 'subsubcategories/1770891779.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770891779_9074.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770891779_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>DRACO Shape</h3><p>Shape Specialization</p><p>The DRACO planter shape is defined by its bold, elongated, and subtly tapered cylindrical profile that delivers a clean, sculptural look. Its smooth curves and tall stance create an eye-catching silhouette, making it ideal for projects where visual height, elegance, and modernity are essential. The DRACO shape enhances spaces by adding vertical emphasis without overpowering the décor.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes: Available in multiple heights—from compact indoor models to tall statement pieces</li><li>Colors &amp; Finishes: Matte, gloss, metallic, ceramic-look, stone finish, and bespoke premium shades</li><li>Textures: Smooth, micro-stone, ribbed, grain, terrazzo-like, and custom textures</li><li>Functional Add-Ons: Drainage holes (optional), Inner liners, Water reservoir system, Lightweight inserts for soil optimization</li><li>Brand Personalization: Corporate logos, hospitality branding, and custom patterns</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Corporate receptions and office lobby spaces</li><li>Hotel entrances, lounge areas, and premium hospitality interiors</li><li>Residential balconies, hallways, and modern living rooms</li><li>Cafés, luxury retail stores, and boutique décor</li><li>Outdoor pathways, pool areas, and terrace landscaping</li></ul><p>Why Choose the DRACO FRP Planter?</p><ul><li>Sleek &amp; Modern Appearance: Its tall, refined silhouette instantly elevates contemporary spaces</li><li>Superior Durability: FRP construction provides high strength, impact resistance, and long lifespan</li><li>Weatherproof Performance: UV-resistant, corrosion-free, moisture-proof—ideal for indoor &amp; outdoor use</li><li>Lightweight &amp; Easy to Move: Despite its height, the planter remains easy to reposition</li><li>Highly Customizable: Designed to adapt seamlessly to any interior theme or landscaping requirement</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:22:59'),
(73, 'GK & GK TRAY', NULL, NULL, 6, 'gk-gk-tray', 'subsubcategories/1770892001.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892056_1225.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770892056_1619.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770892056_8271.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892001_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>GK &amp; GK TRAY Shapes</h3><p>The GK &amp; GK TRAY planter shapes are designed with a clean, geometric structure that blends modern minimalism with functional elegance.</p><p>Shape Specialization</p><p><strong>GK Shape:</strong> Features a refined, tapered profile that creates a sleek vertical balance—perfect for adding height and sophistication.</p><p><strong>GK TRAY Shape:</strong> Offers the same modern form but with added width and surface area, making it ideal for multi-plant displays, layered arrangements, or decorative landscaping.</p><p>Together, these shapes provide versatile styling options suitable for both contemporary interiors and large outdoor environments.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes: Available in multiple heights, widths, and tray-style dimensions</li><li>Colors &amp; Finishes: Matte, gloss, metallic, dual-tone, terra-texture, stone-finish, and premium custom shades</li><li>Textures: Smooth, grainy, sandy, terrazzo-effect, and customized patterns</li><li>Functional Add-ons: Drainage hole customization, inner GI/FRP liners, self-watering systems, lightweight fillers for large tray models</li><li>Branding Options: Custom motifs, logo engraving, and theme-based color palettes</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><p><strong>GK Shape:</strong></p><ul><li>Office cabins, reception areas, hotel suites</li><li>Residential corners, balcony styling, entryway décor</li><li>Indoor trees and tall ornamental plants</li></ul><p><strong>GK TRAY Shape:</strong></p><ul><li>Terrace gardens and large landscaping zones</li><li>Café and restaurant dividers</li><li>Cluster planting, herbs, succulents, and floral arrangements</li><li>Commercial spaces requiring wide horizontal planters</li></ul><p>Why Choose the GK &amp; GK TRAY FRP Planters?</p><ul><li>Modern Versatile Design: Fits perfectly into minimalist, luxury, and architectural environments</li><li>Strong &amp; Lightweight: FRP ensures easy mobility without compromising durability</li><li>Weather-Resistant Construction: UV-proof, rust-free, and ideal for indoor &amp; outdoor usage</li><li>Highly Functional: GK for vertical elegance; GK TRAY for horizontal spread—offering styling flexibility</li><li>Long-lasting Finish: Colors remain vibrant and fade-resistant even in harsh weather</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:27:36'),
(74, 'GLASS', NULL, NULL, 6, 'glass', 'subsubcategories/1770892090.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892090_5519.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892090_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>GLASS Shape</h3><p>The GLASS planter shape is inspired by the clean, smooth contours of a classic glass tumbler. With its perfectly rounded cylindrical body and gently tapered bottom, this shape delivers a sleek, contemporary look that enhances modern architectural spaces. Its fluid design makes it suitable for minimalistic décor themes while still standing out as a statement piece.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes: Multiple height and diameter variations for table-top, medium, and tall floor planters</li><li>Finishes: Gloss, matte, marble-effect, metallic sheen, ceramic-look, and premium stone textures</li><li>Colors: Available in neutrals, luxe metallics, bold accent shades, dual-tones, and full custom color matching</li><li>Functional Features: Drainage hole customization, self-watering system compatibility, lightweight internal fillers for tall versions, optional anti-scratch coats</li><li>Branding &amp; Personalization: Logo engraving, theme-based color palettes, or custom text embossing</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Indoor Styling: Living rooms, lobbies, hotel suites, office reception areas</li><li>Outdoor Landscaping: Patios, terraces, poolside décor, garden walkways</li><li>Plant Types: Indoor palms, flowering plants, foliage plants like ZZ, rubber plant, snake plant; table-top variants ideal for succulents or ornamental greens</li></ul><p>Why Choose the GLASS FRP Planter?</p><ul><li>Modern &amp; Minimalistic Appeal: The fluid cylindrical shape complements contemporary interior and architectural designs</li><li>Lightweight &amp; Durable: FRP construction provides superior strength while remaining easy to move and position</li><li>Weather &amp; UV Resistant: Perfect for both indoor and outdoor use without color fading</li><li>Versatile Functionality: Available in multiple sizes, suitable for homes, offices, hospitality spaces, and landscaping projects</li><li>Premium Finish Quality: Achieves a high-end ceramic or metallic look without the weight or fragility</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:28:10'),
(75, 'LNA', NULL, NULL, 6, 'lna', 'subsubcategories/1770892130.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892130_4419.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892130_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>LNA Shape</h3><p>The LNA planter shape is designed with a refined, elongated taper that provides a tall, elegant silhouette. Its smooth cylindrical body transitions seamlessly into a narrow base, creating a visually striking planter that enhances verticality in any décor setting. The LNA shape adds sophistication to entrances, corridors, and modern architectural spaces.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Size Variants: Slim, tall, medium-height, and compact versions for versatile placement</li><li>Finishes Available: Gloss, matte, stone-texture, metallic finish, marble-effect, and premium ceramic-look coatings</li><li>Color Options: Customizable in single tones, dual tones, metallic shades, bold palettes, or subtle neutrals</li><li>Functional Add-ons: Drain hole options, self-watering module compatibility, weighted base for outdoor use, scratch-resistant and UV-protected coating</li><li>Branding Possibilities: Logo or pattern engraving, custom color themes for hotels, corporates, and large landscaping projects</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Indoor Décor: Hotel lobbies, corporate reception areas, luxury apartments, and hallways</li><li>Outdoor Spaces: Building entrances, terraces, garden pathways, balcony corners</li><li>Ideal Plant Types: Tall indoor palms, snake plants, dracaena varieties, bamboo, decorative foliage</li></ul><p>Why Choose the LNA FRP Planter?</p><ul><li>Elegant &amp; Tall Aesthetic: Perfect for adding height and drama to modern interiors and architectural layouts</li><li>Lightweight Yet Sturdy: FRP construction ensures durability without extra weight</li><li>Weather-Resistant: Withstands sunlight, rain, and temperature changes—ideal for both indoor and outdoor use</li><li>High-End Finish: Delivers a premium, luxury look suitable for upscale commercial and residential projects</li><li>Versatile Placement: The slim taper makes it great for spaces where floor area is limited</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:28:50'),
(76, 'MAX', 'MAX', 'MAX', 6, 'max', 'subsubcategories/1770892341.jpg', 'MAX', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892341_1278.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770892341_3265.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892341_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>MAX Shape</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The MAX planter shape is engineered for bold impact&mdash;featuring a wide upper opening, clean cylindrical lines, and a refined tapered base. Its balanced proportions create a commanding presence while maintaining a sleek, modern aesthetic. The MAX shape is ideal for spaces that require a strong visual anchor without overwhelming the interior or landscape design.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Size Range: Available in compact, medium, and large formats for homes, commercial spaces, and landscapes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish Choices: Matte, gloss, textured, stone finish, metallic finish, or premium marble-look surface</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Options: Any shade&mdash;neutral, bold, metallic, pastel, or dual-tone</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Additional Features: Optional drain holes, self-watering compatibility, UV-resistant coating, heavy base option for stability</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Brand Personalization: Custom logo placement, corporate theme matching, design patterns for large-scale projects</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor: Hotel lobbies, office entrances, luxury homes, retail stores, caf&eacute;s</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Outdoor: Building fa&ccedil;ades, terraces, poolside, garden pathways, patios</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Plant Types: Ficus varieties, Areca palm, Cycas, tropical plants, large foliage species</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose the MAX FRP Planter?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bold, Striking Aesthetic: Wide top + elegant taper create a powerful visual statement</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ultra-Durable FRP Build: Lightweight, strong, corrosion-resistant, weatherproof</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low Maintenance: Fade-proof, easy to clean, crack-resistant</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Premium Look &amp; Versatility: Works with contemporary and classic themes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Space Enhancing: Perfect for highlighting large plants in modern settings</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774439942_69c3ce065d985.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'MAX', 'MAX', 'MAX', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 18:59:13'),
(77, 'P CUP', 'P CUP', 'P CUP', 6, 'p-cup', 'subsubcategories/1770892314.jpg', 'P CUP', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892314_9571.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892314_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>P CUP Shape</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The P CUP planter is designed with a sleek cup-style silhouette, featuring a smooth cylindrical body that subtly tapers toward the base. Its balanced, minimalist geometry makes it an elegant choice for both modern and classic d&eacute;cor themes. The P CUP shape is perfect when you need a planter that blends sophistication with simplicity.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Size Choices: Multiple height and diameter options</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish Options: Matte, gloss, textured, stone-look, metallic, wood-finish, marble coating</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Customization: Pastels, earthy tones, bold shades, metallics, brand colors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Add-Ons: Drain/no-drain options, self-watering compatibility, UV-resistant coating, heavy base for stability</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor: Hotel corridors, reception desks, living rooms, boutique stores, office cabins</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Outdoor: Balconies, walkways, poolside, terraces, entrance gates</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Plant Types: Snake plant, syngonium, ferns, ZZ plant, pothos, flowering plants</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose the P CUP FRP Planter?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Timeless Cup Design: Enhances any d&eacute;cor with clean elegance</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Durable &amp; Lightweight: Crack-resistant, corrosion-free FRP</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Versatile Aesthetic: Complements contemporary &amp; neo-classical spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low Maintenance: Fade-resistant, easy to clean</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Highly Customizable: Tailored sizes, colors, and finishes</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774440051_69c3ce73b3310.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'P CUP', 'P CUP', 'P CUP', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 19:01:07'),
(78, 'PILR', NULL, NULL, 6, 'pilr', 'subsubcategories/1770892408.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892408_9932.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892408_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>PILR Shape</h3><p>The PILR planter features a tall, elegant pillar-like silhouette, designed with a straight cylindrical form that delivers a clean, architectural look. Its vertical elevation adds instant height and drama to any space, making it perfect for statement plant displays. The PILR shape is ideal for creating linear arrangements, framing entrances, or adding structure to landscapes.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Available Sizes: Multiple height &amp; diameter options</li><li>Color Choices: Neutrals, bold shades, metallics, earth tones, custom brand colors</li><li>Surface Finishes: Matte, gloss, stone texture, granule finish, metallic coat, stone-look</li><li>Add-On Features: Drain/no-drain options, UV-resistant coating, self-watering compatibility, reinforced base</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Commercial: Hotel lobbies, offices, cafes, resorts, malls</li><li>Residential: Living rooms, balconies, hallways, terraces, entrances</li><li>Outdoor: Walkways, pool decks, garden peripheries, patios</li><li>Plant Types: Areca palm, fiddle leaf fig, dracaena, bamboo palms, ferns, tall ornamentals</li></ul><p>Why Choose the PILR FRP Planter?</p><ul><li>Architectural Presence: Adds height and strong spatial definition</li><li>Lightweight yet Strong: FRP ensures durability</li><li>Weather &amp; Impact Resistant: Made for long-term indoor/outdoor use</li><li>Easy Maintenance: Fade-proof, corrosion-free, crack-resistant</li><li>Fully Customizable: Shape, size, finish, color according to project theme</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:33:28'),
(79, 'RIB-RD', 'RIB-RD', 'RIB-RD', 6, 'rib-rd', 'subsubcategories/1774432360.png', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1774432360_9310.png\",\"subsubcategories\\/1774432360_4805.png\",\"subsubcategories\\/1774432360_3193.png\",\"subsubcategories\\/1774432360_8330.png\"]', 'subsubcategories/1774432360_breadcrumb.png', '<h3>RIB RD Shape</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The RIB RD planter features a rounded cylindrical silhouette enhanced with elegant ribbed detailing, giving it a sculpted, premium look. The ribbed texture adds depth, sophistication, and a striking visual rhythm&mdash;making this planter stand out in both modern and traditional spaces. Its balanced round structure provides stability while complementing a wide range of plant types.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Customization Options</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size Variants: Multiple diameters and heights for tabletops, floor arrangements, and large landscaping needs</li>\r\n	<li>Color Choices: Matte, gloss, metallic, stone-inspired tones, or fully customized brand colors</li>\r\n	<li>Texture &amp; Finish Options: Fine ribbed or deep ribbed texture; Matte / Gloss / Satin; Stone, marble, or concrete-look finish</li>\r\n	<li>Additional Features: Optional drainage hole, UV-protective coating, lightweight reinforcement, option for self-watering systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Best Used For</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Premium Interiors: Living rooms, studios, foyers, luxury retail spaces</li>\r\n	<li>Commercial Projects: Hotels, restaurants, airports, corporate offices</li>\r\n	<li>Outdoor Areas: Patios, garden pathways, balcony corners, terrace gardens</li>\r\n	<li>Perfect for Plants Such As: Snake plant, Peace lily, Rubber plant, ZZ plant, Low-height palms, Colourful foliage and flowering plants</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Why Choose the RIB RD FRP Planter?</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Distinctive Aesthetic: Ribbed contour adds a bold yet refined design element</li>\r\n	<li>Durable FRP Build: Lightweight, weatherproof, corrosion-resistant, and long-lasting</li>\r\n	<li>Timeless Appeal: Blends effortlessly with modern, classical, and nature-inspired d&eacute;cor</li>\r\n	<li>Low Maintenance: Easy to clean, fade-resistant, and built for high-traffic spaces</li>\r\n	<li>Fully Customizable: Tailor the texture, size, and color to perfectly match your project requirements</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 16:52:41');
INSERT INTO `sub_sub_categories` (`id`, `name`, `bread_heading`, `bread_subheading`, `subcategory_id`, `slug`, `image`, `alt`, `multi_images`, `breadimage`, `description`, `long_desc`, `sort`, `status`, `metatag`, `metadescription`, `metakeywords`, `metatags`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(80, 'RONDO', 'RONDO', 'RONDO', 6, 'rondo', 'subsubcategories/1770892495.jpg', 'RONDO', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892495_9622.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892495_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>RONDO Shape</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The RONDO planter is defined by its smooth, rounded cylindrical profile, offering a clean and contemporary look that blends effortlessly with any d&eacute;cor style. Its gentle curves and uniform symmetry make it a timeless planter shape ideal for both large statement plants and compact indoor greens. The design enhances balance, making it visually appealing from every angle.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes Available: Multiple height and diameter options&mdash;from small indoor pieces to large architectural planters</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Flexibility: Matte, gloss, satin, metallic, earthy tones, or fully customized shades</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish Variations: Smooth finish; Stone / Marble / Concrete texture; Metallic sheen</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Additional Custom Features: UV-resistant outdoor coating, optional drainage hole, reinforced FRP build, option for integrated self-watering system</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern Interiors: Living rooms, hotel lobbies, luxury residences, studio spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Commercial Spaces: Malls, corporate offices, restaurants, airports</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Outdoor Settings: Terrace gardens, porch corners, patio landscaping, pathways</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Suitable Plants Like: Areca palm, Fiddle leaf fig, Monstera, Bamboo palm, Aglaonema, Indoor flowering varieties</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose the RONDO FRP Planter?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Minimalistic &amp; Versatile: Rounded design suits every architectural style</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Premium FRP Durability: Lightweight, weather-resistant, rust-proof</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Elegant Presence: Creates a clean, luxurious visual effect</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low Maintenance: Easy to clean, fade-resistant</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Highly Customizable: Size, finish, and color tailored to any interior or landscape project</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774440171_69c3ceebe2455.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'RONDO', 'RONDO', 'RONDO', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 19:03:03'),
(81, 'SKYLINE', 'SKYLINE', 'SKYLINE', 6, 'skyline', 'subsubcategories/1770892850.jpg', 'SKYLINE', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892850_3445.png\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770892850_6152.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892850_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>SKYLINE &ndash; FRP Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The SKYLINE planter features a tall, sleek, and elegantly tapered silhouette inspired by modern skyscraper architecture. Its elevated vertical form allows plants to gain height and presence effortlessly, making it perfect for creating structured, stylish green statements. With its clean geometry and contemporary appeal, the SKYLINE shape is ideal for spaces that demand height, refinement, and a premium visual impact.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Height &amp; Diameter Options: From medium-height options to extra-tall variants for dramatic effect</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Surface Finishes: Matte, gloss, stone texture, metallic sheen, concrete look, or fine-grain finish</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Palette: Solid colors, dual-shade gradients, metallic tones, custom branding colors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Material Options: Standard FRP or reinforced high-strength FRP</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Add-On Choices: Drainage hole customization, inner waterproof lining, UV protection coating, roller base, brand engraving</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Commercial entrances, lobbies, and reception areas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Luxury hotel corridors, pool decks, and lounges</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern residential balconies, terraces, and living rooms</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Creating vertical accents in open areas or narrow walkways</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Highlighting tall indoor plants, palms, and ornamental grasses</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose This Shape</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Vertical Elegance: Creates height and visual drama instantly</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern Architectural Appeal: Perfect for contemporary and premium d&eacute;cor themes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Space-Saving Design: Tall shape fits well even in compact spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Durable &amp; Weather-Resistant: FRP construction ensures longevity indoors and outdoors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Lightweight &amp; Easy to Relocate: Despite its height, remains portable and manageable</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">High Aesthetic Value: Ideal as a feature planter for designer spaces</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774440248_69c3cf38a0ea0.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'SKYLINE', 'SKYLINE', 'SKYLINE', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 19:04:23'),
(82, 'SQ-RIB-BOT', NULL, NULL, 6, 'sq-rib-bot', 'subsubcategories/1770892715.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892715_5606.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892715_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>SQ Rib Bot – FRP Planters</h3><p>The SQ Rib Bot design features a square-shaped body with elegant ribbed detailing, adding depth and texture to the planter. Its broad base ensures exceptional stability, making it ideal for both indoor and outdoor installations. The clean square geometry blends seamlessly with modern, contemporary, and minimalist décor styles.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes: Small, medium, large, and custom dimensions</li><li>Colors &amp; Finishes: Matte, gloss, stone finish, textured, metallic</li><li>Rib Patterns: Deep ribs, fine ribs, or smooth variants</li><li>Branding: Logo embossing or color-specific branding</li><li>Internal Coating: Waterproofing or root-control lining</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Residential balconies &amp; terraces</li><li>Office lobbies and corporate landscapes</li><li>Retail spaces, showrooms &amp; hospitality settings</li><li>Outdoor pathways, garden borders &amp; poolside décor</li><li>Indoor statement corners and accent displays</li></ul><p>Why Choose This Shape</p><ul><li>Modern Aesthetics: Ribbed design enhances visual appeal</li><li>High Stability: Square bottom prevents tipping</li><li>Space Efficient: Fits neatly into corners and linear layouts</li><li>Durable &amp; Lightweight: Premium FRP for long-lasting use</li><li>Weather Resistant: Suitable for sun, rain, and humid environments</li><li>Design Flexibility: Perfect balance of style and functionality</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:38:35'),
(83, 'T CUP', 'T CUP', 'T CUP', 6, 't-cup', 'subsubcategories/1770892850.jpg', 'T CUP', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892850_9043.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892850_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>T Cup &ndash; FRP Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The T Cup planter is inspired by the soft, rounded silhouette of a classic cup, featuring a wide top opening that narrows gracefully toward the base. Its smooth curves create a refined, contemporary look that enhances both indoor and outdoor spaces. The design allows generous root spread at the top while ensuring a compact footprint&mdash;perfect for elegant landscaping.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes: Multiple height and diameter options, with custom sizing on request</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Colors &amp; Finishes: Gloss, matte, stone-texture, metallic, dual-tone</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Material Thickness: Standard or reinforced for heavy-duty installations</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Branding: Logo engraving, custom colors, and project-specific finishes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Interior Options: Water-resistant lining, drainage options, root-control layers</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotel lobbies, corporate offices &amp; reception areas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Residential balconies, living rooms, and terrace gardens</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Showrooms, retail d&eacute;cor &amp; boutique spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Garden walkways and entrance landscaping</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plant corners and centerpiece displays</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose This Shape</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Elegant Curves: Adds a soft, premium aesthetic to any setting</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Wide Top Opening: Ideal for medium to large plants requiring spread</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Compact Base: Saves floor space without compromising stability</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Weatherproof FRP Build: Lightweight, durable, resistant to moisture &amp; UV</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Versatile Styling: Complements modern, contemporary, and luxury interiors/exteriors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Easy Maintenance: Long-lasting performance with minimal upkeep</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774440370_69c3cfb273113.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'T CUP', 'T CUP', 'T CUP', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 19:06:26'),
(84, 'TGK', 'TGK', 'TGK', 6, 'tgk', 'subsubcategories/1770892993.jpg', 'TGK', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770892993_5736.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770892993_9659.png\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770892993_1253.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770892993_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>TGK &ndash; FRP Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The TGK planter features a bold, geometric silhouette with clean vertical lines and a modern tapered base. Designed to offer a perfect balance of strength, symmetry, and style, TGK brings a contemporary edge to any space. Its structured form enhances plant presentation while maintaining a sleek architectural look.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Size Options: Small, medium, large, fully customized height&ndash;width configurations</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Choices: Matte, gloss, textured, stone, concrete finish, metallic accents</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Thickness Levels: Standard lightweight FRP or reinforced for heavy-duty use</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Branding Options: Custom color codes, logo embossing, project-specific themes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Drainage &amp; Interior: Optional drainage holes, liners, root barrier layers</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Corporate buildings &amp; office entrances</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern residential balconies, patios, &amp; terraces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotels, luxury resorts, premium commercial interiors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Walkways, garden paths, public landscaping</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plant styling and large statement plant displays</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose This Shape</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Architectural Appeal: Geometric design adds a refined, modern touch</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Stability &amp; Strength: Tapered lower structure offers excellent balance</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Design Versatility: Complements minimalistic, corporate, and luxury d&eacute;cor themes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Durable FRP Material: Weather-resistant, lightweight, anti-corrosive &amp; long-lasting</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Effortless Maintenance: Easy cleaning and consistent appearance</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for Statement Plants: Enhances visual impact of tall or sculptural plants</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774440518_69c3d046a07da.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'TGK', 'TGK', 'TGK', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 19:08:49'),
(85, 'VALO', 'VALO', 'VALO', 6, 'valo', 'subsubcategories/1770893079.jpg', 'VALO', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770893121_2076.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770893121_6945.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770893121_5917.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770893121_9140.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770893121_1208.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770893079_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>VALO &ndash; FRP Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The VALO planter is known for its sleek, elongated design that blends modern elegance with functional geometry. Its refined vertical form and subtle tapering create a visually striking presence, making it ideal for creating height, symmetry, and sophistication in any space. VALO is perfect for projects that demand a contemporary and premium aesthetic.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes: Multiple height variations or fully customized dimensions</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Finishes: Matte, gloss, stone, concrete, textured, metallic</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Material Thickness: Standard lightweight or reinforced heavy-duty FRP</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Brand Personalization: Custom color-matching, logo branding, theme-based coatings</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Drainage Features: Optional drainage holes, inner liners, plant-safe root barriers</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Premium hotel lobbies and luxury commercial interiors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office entrances, corridors, corporate reception areas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern balconies, terraces, residential patios</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Walkways, long passages, building entrances, landscape borders</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plant styling with tall ornamental plants</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose This Shape</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Elegant Vertical Appeal: Enhances height and adds a premium modern look</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Space-Saving Construction: Tall, slim design ideal for compact areas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Versatile D&eacute;cor Compatibility: Perfect for luxury, modern, and minimalistic themes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Durable FRP Build: Weatherproof, lightweight, corrosion-resistant, long-lasting</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low Maintenance: Easy to clean and retains finish for years</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for Tall Plants: Complements palms, bamboo, and sculptural greens</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774440621_69c3d0addc311.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'VALO', 'VALO', 'VALO', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 19:10:34'),
(86, 'VERTILIN', 'VERTILIN', 'VERTILIN', 6, 'vertilin', 'subsubcategories/1770893249.jpg', 'VERTILIN', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770893300_7092.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770893300_8620.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770893300_4111.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770893249_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>VERTILIN &ndash; FRP Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The VERTILIN planter stands out with its tall, linear, and sharply structured profile. Designed to emphasize verticality, it creates a strong architectural impact in both indoor and outdoor environments. Its clean, straight-edge silhouette makes it a perfect choice for contemporary spaces that require neat alignment, symmetry, and a refined minimalist aesthetic.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Size Variations: Multiple height and width options or complete dimension customization</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish Options: Matte, gloss, stone-effect, wooden textured, concrete-look, metallic coatings</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Customization: RAL color matching and theme-specific palettes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Material Strength: Light, medium, or heavy-duty FRP</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Optional Add-ons: Drainage holes, internal liners, castors, branding elements, UV-resistant coatings</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">High-end commercial complexes, hotels, office buildings</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Corridor edges, walkways, long architectural stretches</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern balconies, terraces, rooftop gardens</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Entrances requiring tall, sleek planters for a welcoming aesthetic</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor statement corners with tall plants or decorative arrangements</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose This Shape</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Architectural Appeal: Sharp linear design enhances modern and minimalist spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for Tall Greens: Works beautifully with bamboo, palms, vertical ornamental plants</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Space-Efficient: Slim footprint ideal for compact/narrow areas</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Long-Lasting FRP Material: Weather-resistant, rust-free, lightweight, durable</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Highly Versatile: Complements luxury, corporate, residential, landscape themes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low Maintenance: Designed for long-term use with minimal upkeep</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774440714_69c3d10a1114a.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'VERTILIN', 'VERTILIN', 'VERTILIN', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 19:12:08'),
(87, 'VNR', 'VNR', 'VNR', 6, 'vnr', 'subsubcategories/1770893345.jpg', 'VNR', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770893345_2166.png\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770893345_9939.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770893345_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>VNR &ndash; FRP Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The VNR planter is crafted with a refined cylindrical&ndash;tapered silhouette that blends modern elegance with functional simplicity. Its smooth, narrowing profile creates a visually balanced shape that complements both minimalistic and premium design themes. The VNR shape is ideal for spaces that demand symmetry, sophistication, and a subtle yet impactful planter form.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Size Customization: Multiple height and diameter options</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish Choices: Matte, gloss, textured, stone finish, wooden effect, metallic coating</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Options: Full RAL color range, earthy tones, premium metallics, custom palettes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Material Options: Standard or heavy-duty FRP</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Optional Features: Drainage holes, internal waterproofing, roller castors, custom branding, UV protection</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Corporate offices, reception areas, commercial lobbies</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Residential living rooms, balconies, terraces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Landscaped pathways, garden corners, open courtyards</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotels, restaurants, premium retail environments</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Areas where a soft, rounded yet structured aesthetic is desired</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose This Shape</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Elegant Tapered Silhouette: Enhances visual harmony and adds height</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for Medium to Tall Plants: Palms, ficus, dracaena, ornamental indoor plants</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Highly Adaptable: Fits contemporary and traditional architectural styles</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Lightweight &amp; Durable: FRP construction ensures long life with minimal maintenance</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Space-Efficient Design: Rounded taper suitable for tighter layouts</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Premium Aesthetic: Clean, polished, upscale look in any setting</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774440821_69c3d175464ea.jpg\" style=\"height:207px; width:700px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'VNR', 'VNR', 'VNR', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 19:14:01'),
(88, 'WAVY', NULL, NULL, 6, 'wavy', 'subsubcategories/1770893361.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770893361_8895.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770893361_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>WAVY – FRP Planters</h3><p>The WAVY planter is designed to stand out with its beautifully sculpted, ripple-like exterior pattern. The flowing wavy texture adds movement, depth, and a dynamic visual appeal to any space. Its cylindrical–tapered geometry enhances balance and elegance, making it a perfect fusion of artistry and functionality. The WAVY shape becomes an instant focal point, ideal for premium interiors and curated landscapes.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes Available: Multiple height and diameter combinations</li><li>Finish Options: Matte, glossy, satin, stone texture, handcrafted effects, metallic finishes</li><li>Color Customization: Full RAL colors, natural tones, dual-tone, gradients, custom brand colors</li><li>Fabrication Variants: Standard/lightweight FRP or reinforced heavy-duty FRP</li><li>Additional Features: Drainage holes, inner waterproof coating, UV protection, roller base, custom engraving</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Luxurious hotel lobbies, resort walkways, premium hospitality venues</li><li>Residential living rooms, verandas, balconies, terraces</li><li>High-end commercial spaces, boutiques, office receptions</li><li>Indoor landscaping with statement plants</li><li>Outdoor gardens requiring decorative yet durable planters</li></ul><p>Why Choose This Shape</p><ul><li>Distinctive Wavy Texture: Creates standout ornamental appeal</li><li>Perfect for Statement Plants: Enhances indoor palms, dracaena, ferns, ornamental flowering plants</li><li>Premium Aesthetic: Adds sophistication and visual drama</li><li>Highly Durable &amp; Lightweight: Long-lasting performance in all weather conditions</li><li>Versatile Styling: Blends with modern, artistic, luxury-themed interiors/landscapes</li><li>Low Maintenance: Resistant to rust, fading, moisture, and impact</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:49:21'),
(89, 'Z-CUT', NULL, NULL, 6, 'z-cut', 'subsubcategories/1770893391.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770893391_4193.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770893391_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3>Z CUT – FRP Planters</h3><p>The Z CUT planter stands out with its unique, geometric cut design, creating a modern, edgy silhouette. Characterized by a bold \"Z-shaped\" tapered profile, this planter brings contemporary aesthetics into any environment. The clean lines and sharp angles make it a preferred option for design-forward spaces that demand sophistication with a touch of architectural flair. Perfect for those seeking a sculptural element in their décor.</p><p>Customization Options</p><ul><li>Sizes: Multiple heights and diameters to match plant types</li><li>Finish Styles: Glossy, matte, stone finish, textured gradients, metallic polish, custom handcrafted effects</li><li>Color Choices: Any RAL color, dual-tone styling, bespoke brand shades</li><li>Material Strength: Standard lightweight FRP or reinforced heavy-duty FRP</li><li>Additional Add-ons: Drainage hole customization, inner waterproof coating, UV protection, roller base, custom logos/branding</li></ul><p>Best Used For</p><ul><li>Modern commercial interiors: offices, showrooms, reception areas</li><li>Premium residences, entrance foyers, balconies, living spaces</li><li>Luxury hotels, restaurants, hospitality settings</li><li>Minimalist and contemporary gardens</li><li>Accent placements that require striking shapes and clean lines</li></ul><p>Why Choose This Shape</p><ul><li>Architectural Aesthetic: Z-cut profile adds depth, character, visual drama</li><li>Perfect for Modern Décor: Complements minimalist, futuristic, geometric interior themes</li><li>Strong &amp; Durable: FRP ensures long-lasting performance indoors and outdoors</li><li>Lightweight &amp; Easy to Move: Planter remains highly portable</li><li>Styling Flexibility: Ideal for tall plants, foliage, ornamental flowering species</li><li>Low Maintenance: Resistant to weather, moisture, rust, and fading</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 17:49:51'),
(90, 'Ben', 'Ben', 'Ben', 7, 'ben', 'subsubcategories/1770897612.png', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770897612_8698.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770897612_3134.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770897612_breadcrumb.png', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Ben &ndash; Bento Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Ben planter brings subtle elegance and everyday versatility to modern interiors. Designed with a smooth, clean form and thoughtfully balanced proportions, this planter complements any d&eacute;cor style&mdash;minimalist, contemporary, or classic. Ben is crafted to highlight the beauty of your plants while blending seamlessly into both personal and professional spaces.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Shape Specialization</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Ben planter features a soft cylindrical silhouette with gently rounded edges, giving it a refined, universal appeal. Its shape allows for optimal soil depth and root space, making it suitable for a wide range of indoor plants. The simplicity of its form ensures that it enhances the plant without overpowering the aesthetics of the space.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Customization Options</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Available in multiple ceramic colours such as whites, greys, greens, and earthy tones.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Offered in a variety of sizes&mdash;ideal for desktops, living room corners, elevated stands, or balcony railings.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">For bulk and project-based requirements, custom colours, finishes (matte/glossy/textured), and size adaptations can be provided.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Branding or logo customization can be included for corporate gifting or bulk procurement.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Best Used For</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern homes, living rooms, study areas, and bedroom styling</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office spaces, reception zones, and conference rooms</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Caf&eacute;s, boutiques, hospitality spaces, and themed d&eacute;cor setups</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plants such as snake plants, pothos, peace lilies, money plants, bamboo palms, and succulents</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Displaying plant arrangements on floors, tabletops, or shelves</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its balanced design makes Ben suitable for both decorative and functional indoor greenery.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Why Choose Ben</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Ben for its versatile design, strong ceramic build, and universal appeal. Its minimalist aesthetics pair well with any d&eacute;cor theme, while the high-quality finish ensures durability and long-lasting beauty. The Ben planter offers the perfect combination of style, utility, and affordability&mdash;making it a preferred choice for homeowners, interior designers, and commercial spaces. Bring home the Ben planter and experience effortless elegance in every corner of your space.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774433555_69c3b513f1bf8.png\" style=\"height:339px; width:300px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Ben', 'Ben', 'Ben', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:14:07'),
(91, 'Cleo', 'Cleo', 'Cleo', 7, 'cleo', 'subsubcategories/1770893722.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770893722_6822.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770893722_6745.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770893722_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Cleo &ndash; Bento Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Cleo collection brings together modern form, artistic texture, and luxury ceramic craftsmanship. Designed with a signature ribbed finish and a raised pedestal base, Cleo planters add both elegance and personality to any space. Their refined aesthetic, combined with versatile sizing and beautiful colour options, makes them a favourite for contemporary homes, offices, and styled interiors.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>Shape Specialization</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Cleo planter stands out with its refined ribbed vertical pattern and elevated base, creating a modern sculptural look. Its clean cylindrical body paired with a pedestal-inspired bottom adds height, balance, and sophistication to any space. The design blends minimalism with texture, making Cleo a perfect statement piece for contemporary interiors.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Cleo planters are available in a curated selection of elegant ceramic colours&mdash;ranging from earthy greens and browns to warm terracotta and soft pastels. You can choose from multiple sizes to suit small indoor plants or medium decorative greens. For bulk and project orders, customized colours and finish options (matte, glossy, or textured) can also be provided to match your interior theme or brand palette.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern homes and living rooms needing a stylish d&eacute;cor accent</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office desks, reception counters, and breakout areas</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Boutiques, caf&eacute;s, and studio interiors that require chic display elements</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Balconies, shelves, and side tables for compact greenery</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plants like succulents, money plants, ferns, small palms, jade, and flowering varieties</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its compact, balanced form fits effortlessly into both decorative and functional styling.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Cleo</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Cleo for its premium ceramic quality, artistic texture, and timeless appeal. Every planter is crafted to deliver an exceptional finish, long-lasting durability, and effortless d&eacute;cor compatibility. Cleo adds character without overwhelming a space&mdash;making it a favourite choice for designers, stylists, and homeowners who appreciate elegance in simplicity. Bring home the Cleo planter and elevate your space with a blend of craftsmanship, colour, and contemporary design.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774433723_69c3b5bbb4f80.png\" style=\"height:395px; width:300px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Cleo', 'Cleo', 'Cleo', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:15:38'),
(92, 'Hexanest', 'Hexanest', 'Hexanest', 7, 'hexanest', 'subsubcategories/1770893990.jpg', 'Hexanest', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770893990_3503.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770893990_3843.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770893990_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>HEXANEST &ndash; Bento Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">HEXANEST brings a bold geometric identity to your d&eacute;cor through its signature hexagonal form and seamless ceramic finish. Designed for spaces that appreciate structure, symmetry, and contemporary aesthetics, this collection blends artistic geometry with practical planting depth. HEXANEST planters offer a modern edge while still harmonizing beautifully with both minimal and richly decorated interiors.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">HEXANEST planters are defined by their distinct hexagonal silhouette, offering a refreshing alternative to traditional round or square pots. The clean, angular edges create a sculptural profile, making the planter a natural focal point in any setting. The shape not only elevates visual appeal but also provides stability and balanced space for root growth&mdash;perfect for medium to compact indoor plants.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Available in curated ceramic shades&mdash;from elegant neutrals to warm terracotta and premium glossy finishes.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple size options to fit desktops, shelves, corners, and entryway d&eacute;cor.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">For bulk orders, customized colours, finishes (matte/glossy/textured), and size adaptations can be offered to match interior themes, brand palettes, or project requirements.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern living rooms, office cabins, and contemporary workspaces</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Minimalist interior setups needing a geometric accent</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Caf&eacute;s, lobbies, boutiques, and styled photo backgrounds</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plants like ZZ, snake plants, pothos, aglaonema, jade, and ferns</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Creating modular arrangements&mdash;pairing multiple hexagonal planters together for a design-forward cluster look</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The geometric shape makes HEXANEST perfect for creating symmetry and stylish plant layouts.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose HEXANEST</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose HEXANEST for its architectural design, premium ceramic craftsmanship, and ability to transform a simple corner into a design statement. The hexagonal form introduces structure and modernity, while the durable ceramic build ensures longevity and a refined finish. If you are looking for a planter that is both functional and visually striking, HEXANEST is the ideal choice. Bring contemporary geometry into your space with HEXANEST&mdash;where design meets sophistication.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774433840_69c3b630b8367.png\" style=\"height:313px; width:300px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Hexanest', 'Hexanest', 'Hexanest', 'Hexanest', NULL, '2026-03-25 17:17:59'),
(93, 'Piko', 'Piko', 'Piko', 7, 'piko', 'subsubcategories/1770894776.jpg', 'Piko', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770894777_1129.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770894777_1994.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770894776_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>Piko &ndash; Bento Ceramic Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Piko planter is designed for those who appreciate compact charm and modern simplicity. With its neat proportions and smooth finish, Piko adds a refreshing touch of elegance to small and medium indoor spaces. Its subtle yet stylish presence makes it perfect for desktops, shelves, and cosy corners where a hint of greenery can make all the difference.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Piko stands out with its rounded, softly tapered silhouette, making it both visually pleasing and functionally versatile. The shape offers excellent stability while providing enough depth for plant roots to thrive. Its smooth curves and minimalist profile allow it to blend beautifully into contemporary and compact d&eacute;cor settings, enhancing spaces without clutter.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Available in multiple ceramic colours such as muted greens, ivory, charcoal grey, terracotta, and pastel tones.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Comes in different size options suitable for small plants, tabletop arrangements, and window-side d&eacute;cor.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bulk and project-based customization options include custom colour palettes, matte, glossy, or textured finishes, special size requirements, and branding/logo printing for corporate gifting or hospitality setups.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Workstations, study tables, and side tables</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Compact home d&eacute;cor spaces like bookshelves, window ledges, and bedside corners</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Caf&eacute;s, studios, boutique counters, and small display shelves</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plants such as succulents, miniature ferns, money plants, ZZ cuttings, jade, and air-purifying desk-friendly plants</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Creating coordinated plant clusters in small spaces</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Piko</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Piko for its compact elegance, premium ceramic build, and effortless styling potential. Its minimalist design brings a calming, modern appeal to any environment, while its durable finish ensures long-lasting beauty. Whether for personal d&eacute;cor, workspace enhancement, or commercial display, Piko delivers both charm and practicality. Bring home the Piko planter and elevate small spaces with thoughtful design and refined craftsmanship.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774434001_69c3b6d170f33.png\" style=\"height:274px; width:300px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Piko', 'Piko', 'Piko', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:20:32'),
(94, 'Bambusa', 'Bambusa', 'Bambusa', 8, 'bambusa', 'subsubcategories/1770894918.jpg', 'Bambusa', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770894918_8610.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770894918_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>BAMBUSA &ndash; Lark Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Inspired by the timeless elegance of bamboo, BAMBUSA brings a natural, sculpted charm to contemporary interiors and outdoor spaces. This sub-category of Lark Ceramic Planters is designed for those who appreciate clean lines, organic silhouettes, and a balanced blend of modern and earthy aesthetics. Crafted with precision, BAMBUSA planters complement minimal, boho, and luxury d&eacute;cor styles alike.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bento Ceramic Planters</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">BAMBUSA planters are characterized by their slim, elongated, and bamboo-inspired cylindrical form. The smooth tapering and rounded edges give them a soft, organic look while maintaining structural stability. Their vertical emphasis makes them perfect for enhancing height, adding proportion, and creating a sculptural focal point in any setting.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple sizes to accommodate small succulents to tall ornamental plants</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Matte, gloss, or textured finishes inspired by natural bamboo</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom colors ranging from earthy neutrals to premium statement hues</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Option for drainage holes to suit indoor or outdoor placement</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bringing height and elegance to living rooms, lobbies, balconies, and patios</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Showcasing indoor palms, bamboo plants, snake plants, and ornamental grasses</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Styling corners, entrances, or minimalist d&eacute;cor themes</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Creating uniform, linear arrangements in luxury commercial spaces</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose BAMBUSA</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">BAMBUSA offers a beautifully balanced design that merges organic inspiration with modern craftsmanship. Lightweight yet durable ceramic construction ensures long-term use. It complements a wide variety of plant types and d&eacute;cor styles while adding height, structure, and a sense of natural harmony to any environment.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774434146_69c3b76233ea5.png\" style=\"height:451px; width:300px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Bambusa', 'Bambusa', 'Bambusa', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:22:43');
INSERT INTO `sub_sub_categories` (`id`, `name`, `bread_heading`, `bread_subheading`, `subcategory_id`, `slug`, `image`, `alt`, `multi_images`, `breadimage`, `description`, `long_desc`, `sort`, `status`, `metatag`, `metadescription`, `metakeywords`, `metatags`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(95, 'Oasis', 'Oasis', 'Oasis', 8, 'oasis', 'subsubcategories/1770895060.jpg', 'Oasis', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770895060_3185.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770895060_1289.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770895060_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>Oasis &ndash; Lark Ceramic Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Oasis planter from the Lark Ceramic Collection brings a refreshing blend of modern simplicity and soft curves. Designed to create a calming visual presence, its smooth rounded profile and clean surface make it an effortless d&eacute;cor piece for any environment. Oasis embodies balance&mdash;minimalistic enough to blend in, yet stylish enough to elevate the look of any room or landscape. Perfect for homes, workspaces, and premium commercial settings, it adds a touch of serenity wherever placed.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Oasis planter features a gently curved, bowl-inspired silhouette that creates a soothing and harmonious aesthetic. Its wide opening and rounded body provide excellent soil depth, allowing plants to flourish comfortably.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Soft, fluid contours ideal for contemporary and organic-themed interiors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Balanced proportions that suit tabletops, shelves, and floor-style displays</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The rounded design enhances plant visibility, making greens appear fuller and more vibrant</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for indoor arrangements requiring a smooth, modern design element</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Options: Available in a variety of ceramic hues&mdash;neutrals, pastels, earthy tones, and designer shades</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finishes: Choose between matte, gloss, speckled, and handcrafted textures</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes: Multiple small-to-medium variants suited for decorative plants, gifting, and tabletop styling</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bulk Orders: Custom shades and finish treatments can be arranged for interior projects or brand-themed d&eacute;cor</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Living rooms, bedrooms, and minimal d&eacute;cor setups</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office desks, conference rooms, and corporate interiors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Caf&eacute;s, boutique stores, and hospitality spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Entry consoles, wall shelves, and study tables</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plants such as succulents, jade, snake plants, pothos, ferns, and flowering d&eacute;cor</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its soft form supports both functional planting and stylish interior storytelling.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Oasis</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Oasis for its timeless simplicity, premium ceramic craft, and versatility across d&eacute;cor styles. Every planter is kiln-fired to ensure durability, long-lasting color, and a consistently smooth finish. Its rounded elegance makes it a favorite among interior stylists looking for subtle yet impactful d&eacute;cor pieces. Oasis brings harmony, beauty, and modern design into any space&mdash;effortlessly.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774434236_69c3b7bce605e.png\" style=\"height:95px; width:500px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Oasis', 'Oasis', 'Oasis', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:24:26'),
(96, 'Pipo', 'Pipo', 'Pipo', 8, 'pipo', 'subsubcategories/1770895330.jpg', 'Pipo', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770895330_4461.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770895330_6275.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770895330_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Pipo &ndash; Lark Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Pipo planter is a truly distinctive d&eacute;cor element designed to stand out through its playful yet elegant form. Featuring a stacked-ring silhouette with smooth, rounded edges, Pipo adds a sculptural, contemporary charm to any space. Its artistic profile makes it more than just a planter&mdash;it becomes a d&eacute;cor highlight, perfect for homes, studios, caf&eacute;s, and modern interiors that appreciate bold and creative design.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Pipo planter is defined by its unique stacked circular-ring structure, giving it a soft, fluid, and modern appearance.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A bold, ring-inspired shape that instantly draws attention</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Smooth, curved edges create a harmonious and organic design language</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Wide, open-mouth design suitable for arrangements that require spread and visibility</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Functions beautifully as a statement tabletop piece or floor planter</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Excellent fit for interiors aiming for artistic, sculptural aesthetics</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Colors: Choose from elegant ceramic hues including blush reds, whites, pastels, earthy tones, and designer shades</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finishes: Options in glossy, matte, dual-tone, and handcrafted textures</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes: Available in small and medium variations for both compact and open spaces</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Project Customization: Bulk orders can be customized with brand-specific colors or special finishes</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern homes, living rooms, and entry displays</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office d&eacute;cor, reception counters, and breakout zones</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Caf&eacute;s, boutique stores, and creative studios</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Minimalist or artistic interior themes</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Low-to-medium height plants such as succulents, bonsai, jade, ferns, pothos/trailing plants, small flowering plants</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Decorative arrangements such as dried flowers or minimal greenery</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its sculptural shape makes Pipo perfect for visual styling, centerpieces, and accent displays.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Pipo</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Pipo for its distinctive design, premium ceramic craftsmanship, and versatile d&eacute;cor value. Each piece is meticulously glazed and kiln-fired to ensure long-lasting color, smooth texture, and durability. Pipo combines creativity with function, making it a favorite for interior stylists and modern homeowners. If you&#39;re looking for a planter that doubles as an art piece&mdash;Pipo is the perfect choice.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774434334_69c3b81e2fa66.png\" style=\"height:253px; width:500px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Pipo', 'Pipo', 'Pipo', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:26:16'),
(97, 'Ropin', 'Ropin', 'Ropin', 8, 'ropin', 'subsubcategories/1770895387.jpg', 'Ropin', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770895387_6761.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770895387_2937.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770895387_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Ropin &ndash; Lark Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Ropin planter brings a refreshing blend of texture, craftsmanship, and contemporary design. Characterized by its subtle rope-inspired grooves, this planter adds depth, character, and visual interest to any setting. Ropin beautifully balances minimalism with artisanal detailing&mdash;making it a standout choice for interiors that value understated sophistication. Its clean ceramic finish and elegant form make it versatile for both modern homes and upscale commercial d&eacute;cor.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ropin is defined by its rope-textured exterior, giving the planter a tactile and stylish appearance.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Soft cylindrical silhouette with detailed linear grooves</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Rope-inspired texture creates a handcrafted, artisanal feel</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ideal for spaces that appreciate subtle patterning over loud design</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The shape supports excellent plant visibility and balanced growth</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Works well as a tabletop highlight or a standalone floor planter</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Range: Available in premium ceramic shades&mdash;earthy neutrals, modern whites, deep greys, terracotta, pastels, and custom designer tones</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finishes: Glossy, matte, semi-matte, and textured glaze options</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizing: Offered in small, medium, and d&eacute;cor-friendly dimensions to suit both compact and open spaces</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bulk Project Customization: Custom colors, finishes, and special glaze treatments available for interior designers and brand projects</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern living rooms, bedrooms, and personal d&eacute;cor corners</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office desks, waiting areas, and reception counters</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Boutique stores, caf&eacute;s, studios, and themed interiors</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shelves, consoles, bedside tables, and entry d&eacute;cor setups</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plants such as snake plants, ferns, money plants, jade, syngonium, flowering indoor varieties</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Ropin</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Ropin for its premium craftsmanship, unique textured detailing, and timeless design versatility. Each planter undergoes high-quality ceramic firing and glazing to ensure strength, durability, and a flawless finish. Ropin stands out without overpowering a space, making it a preferred choice for interior designers and modern homeowners. Ropin is where modern form meets artisanal texture&mdash;perfect for elevating any space with style and subtle luxury.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774434434_69c3b8827c232.png\" style=\"height:132px; width:300px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Ropin', 'Ropin', 'Ropin', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:27:33'),
(98, 'Terra', 'Terra', 'Terra', 8, 'terra', 'subsubcategories/1770895770.jpg', 'Terra', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770895770_7092.png\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770895770_9002.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770895770_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Terra &ndash; Lark Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Terra planter brings the warmth of earth-inspired design into modern living spaces. Crafted with smooth curves and a natural, grounded aesthetic, Terra combines simplicity with elegance. Its organic form and refined ceramic finish make it a favorite for interiors that embrace calm, nature-driven styling. Terra adds subtle sophistication while allowing the beauty of plants to take center stage, making it a versatile d&eacute;cor element for both homes and commercial environments.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Terra stands out with its soft, rounded profile and clean minimalistic silhouette.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Gently curved shape that mimics the natural contours of handcrafted pottery</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Balanced proportions ideal for creating a serene, earthy visual appeal</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A wide opening that allows plants to spread naturally and appear fuller</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for minimalist, Scandinavian, rustic, or contemporary interior themes</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Blends seamlessly into tabletops, consoles, and floor d&eacute;cor setups</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Color Variants: Available in natural ceramic shades&mdash;clay, stone, beige, soft greys, and modern white tones</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finishes: Matte, satin, glossy, textured, or handcrafted glaze options</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes: Offered in small, medium, and large variants suitable for both indoor d&eacute;cor and small landscaping elements</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Project Customization: Special colors and glazing styles available for bulk orders, brand themes, and interior design projects</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Living rooms, bedrooms, and calm aesthetic corners</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office cabins, collaborative spaces, and reception d&eacute;cor</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Spas, caf&eacute;s, boutique stores, and wellness-themed interiors</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shelf styling, console displays, and floor plant arrangements</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Suitable for indoor palms, syngonium, snake plants, pothos and money plants, ferns, decorative flowering plants</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Terra</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Terra for its earthy elegance, superior ceramic craftsmanship, and timeless appeal. Each planter is meticulously kiln-fired for strength, durability, and long-lasting color. Terra&rsquo;s smooth, organic form enhances any plant placed in it, offering a balanced blend of style and tranquility. If you want a planter that brings nature, warmth, and refined artistry into your space&mdash;Terra is the perfect choice.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774434537_69c3b8e9b7f43.png\" style=\"height:224px; width:300px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Terra', 'Terra', 'Terra', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:29:13'),
(99, 'Azure', 'Azure', 'Azure', 9, 'azure', 'subsubcategories/1770895511.jpg', 'Azure', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770895511_3327.png\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770895511_5060.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770895511_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>AZURE &ndash; Soto Ceramic Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">AZURE planters embody refined modernity with a smooth, clean silhouette and a glossy ceramic finish that instantly elevates any environment. Their balanced proportions make them a versatile choice for minimalist and luxurious d&eacute;cor themes.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The sleek cylindrical shape with rounded edges offers a continuous, premium surface and modern aesthetic.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Balanced proportions ideal for showcasing foliage.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Clean silhouette that blends into any space.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for uncluttered, contemporary d&eacute;cor styles.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Various sizes for tabletops, consoles, and floor d&eacute;cor.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple high-gloss colours to match interiors.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom finishes and colour palettes for brand or project requirements.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Living rooms, bedrooms, hallways, and office d&eacute;cor.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Boutiques, reception areas, and lounges.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Plants like Peace Lily, Philodendron, Areca Palm, Fiddle Leaf Baby, and Money Plant.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Minimalist, Scandinavian, and premium modern interiors.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose AZURE Ceramic Planters</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Timeless, sleek design.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Premium ceramic durability and visual appeal.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">High-gloss luxurious finish.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Versatile styling across homes and commercial spaces.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ideal proportions for healthy plant growth.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774434648_69c3b958aae92.png\" style=\"height:204px; width:300px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Azure', 'Azure', 'Azure', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:31:17'),
(100, 'Diamante', 'Diamante', 'Diamante', 9, 'diamante', 'subsubcategories/1770895566.jpg', 'Diamante', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770895566_8119.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770895566_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>DIAMANTE &ndash; Soto Ceramic Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">DIAMANTE is where artistic geometry meets modern elegance. Inspired by diamond-cut facets, this planter series adds a sculptural dimension to interiors while offering durable functionality. Its reflective finish and bold contours make it a statement d&eacute;cor element.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Defined by a faceted geometric surface, DIAMANTE creates a dramatic play of light and shadow.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Strong, structured silhouette for high-impact d&eacute;cor.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Wide top opening for better plant breathability.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Stable base suited for indoor and semi-outdoor spaces.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes for tabletops, consoles, corners, and floor displays.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish options: matte, satin, high-gloss.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom colour palettes for branding or interior design.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Suitable for various plant types including succulents and ornamental greens.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern living rooms, luxury offices, statement corners.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotel lobbies, boutiques, salons, curated d&eacute;cor setups.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Plants like Snake Plant, ZZ Plant, Jade, Syngonium, Aglaonema, Bonsai.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Interiors where geometric aesthetics enhance the environment.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose DIAMANTE Ceramic Planters</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bold geometric design with sculptural appeal.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Durable ceramic with lasting shine.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Balances art and practical plant use.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ideal for premium d&eacute;cor styling.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Fits effortlessly into modern and design-forward themes.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774434758_69c3b9c6b937f.png\" style=\"height:153px; width:300px\" /></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Diamante', 'Diamante', 'Diamante', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:32:58'),
(101, 'Fleur', 'Fleur', 'Fleur', 9, 'fleur', 'subsubcategories/1770895750.jpg', 'Fleur', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770895750_4393.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770895750_2882.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770895750_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Fleur &ndash; Bento Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Fleur Bento Ceramic Planters bring a refined blend of modern elegance and soft aesthetics to contemporary spaces. Designed with clean cylindrical contours and a vertically ribbed texture, Fleur enhances the natural beauty of plants while adding a premium decorative element to both indoor and outdoor settings. Their smooth ceramic glaze and timeless form make them a popular choice for homes, offices, hospitality spaces, and curated design environments.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Fleur planters feature a rounded cylindrical silhouette combined with a uniform ribbed pattern, giving them a sophisticated yet understated presence.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The ribbing adds depth and visual texture, making the planter stand out even in minimalist settings.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Their wide opening and gently curved base are ideal for accommodating medium to large plants.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">This shape ensures balanced root development and excellent plant stability.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sizes &ndash; Available in multiple heights and diameters to suit tabletops, corners, and large floor installations.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Colors &amp; Finishes &ndash; Choose from soft neutrals, deep contemporary hues, matte or glossy finishes.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Glaze Variations &ndash; Smooth gloss, satin matte, or premium textured glazing based on aesthetic preference.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for ornamental indoor plants like rubber plants, calatheas, ferns, or ZZ plants.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ideal for lobbies, living rooms, balconies, office reception areas, and hotel interiors.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Timeless shape suitable for both modern minimalist d&eacute;cor and luxurious interior themes.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Fleur Bento Ceramic Planters</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Premium Craftsmanship &ndash; High-quality ceramic with a meticulously applied ribbed texture.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Aesthetic Appeal &ndash; Instantly uplifts ambience with its elegant form and sophisticated finish.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Durability &ndash; Strong ceramic material designed to withstand moisture and daily use.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Design Versatility &ndash; Blends seamlessly with Scandinavian, modern, and luxury d&eacute;cor palettes.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for Styled Greenery &ndash; Enhances plant impact, making plants statement pieces.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774434858_69c3ba2a3a37e.png\" style=\"height:144px; width:500px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Fleur', 'Fleur', 'Fleur', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:34:40'),
(102, 'Greko', 'Greko', 'Greko', 9, 'greko', 'subsubcategories/1770895769.jpg', 'Greko', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770895769_9087.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770895769_4115.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770895769_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Greko &ndash; Bento Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Greko series from the Soto collection embodies modern craftsmanship with a bold, textured personality. Designed with a distinctive ribbed pattern and a contemporary low-profile form, these ceramic planters add a sculptural touch to any space. Their smooth, glossy finish and luxurious colour palette make them a stylish choice for d&eacute;cor enthusiasts who value both aesthetics and functionality.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Greko planters feature a low, wide cylindrical silhouette enhanced with deep vertical fluting. This ribbed structure creates visual depth while maintaining a clean geometric form.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The low height provides excellent stability and is ideal for plants that thrive in broad-growing spaces.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple glaze finishes: matte, glossy, or semi-gloss.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Colour choices: earthy neutrals, contemporary pastels, bold tones.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Size variations: perfect for tabletop d&eacute;cor, balconies, or indoor corners.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Optional drainage: with or without drainage holes and matching trays.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Succulents, herbs, and tabletop plants thrive in wider containers.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office desks, console tables, window sills, and coffee tables.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern, Scandinavian, minimalist interiors and boutique-style d&eacute;cor setups.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Greko?</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Architectural Texture &ndash; Ribbed detailing adds a premium contemporary touch.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Durable Ceramic Build &ndash; High-quality kiln-fired clay ensures longevity.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Versatile Styling &ndash; Works beautifully in homes, offices, caf&eacute;s, and retail spaces.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Aesthetic Impact &ndash; Acts as both a planter and a visual statement piece.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774434946_69c3ba82c5dcf.png\" style=\"height:233px; width:300px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Greko', 'Greko', 'Greko', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:36:08'),
(103, 'Zara', 'Zara', 'Zara', 9, 'zara', 'subsubcategories/1770896885.jpg', 'Zara', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770896885_6111.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770896885_6026.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770896885_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>ZARA &ndash; Soto Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">ZARA planters from the Soto Ceramic Collection embody contemporary elegance with a soft, tapered silhouette that feels both minimalistic and refined. Their clean, glossy finish and subtly widening base create a balanced form that enhances any modern interior.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">ZARA features a tapered cylindrical form that offers a smooth, uninterrupted surface for a premium aesthetic.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Stable base ideal for tall or medium-height plants.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Sculptural look complements sleek and contemporary d&eacute;cor themes.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Understated silhouette perfect for minimalist spaces.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple sizes suited for desktops, corners, entryways, and accent styling.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Colour variants in solid, premium gloss finishes.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">High-gloss coatings for an ultra-polished look.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor corners, living rooms, offices, and workspaces.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hotel lobbies, reception areas, and lounges.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Plants like Snake Plant, ZZ Plant, Rubber Plant, Bamboo Palm, and other tall foliage.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Minimalist and monochromatic d&eacute;cor themes.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose ZARA Ceramic Planters</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Minimalistic design that elevates high-end interiors.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Premium ceramic craftsmanship with clean, refined surfaces.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Stable shape suited for tall or vertical plants.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Durable for long-term indoor or semi-outdoor use.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Effortlessly blends with modern architectural styles.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774435097_69c3bb194eda0.png\" style=\"height:214px; width:300px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Zara', 'Zara', 'Zara', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:38:28'),
(104, 'Botan', 'Botan', 'Botan', 10, 'botan', 'subsubcategories/1770896204.jpg', 'Botan', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770896204_7742.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770896204_3533.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770896204_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>BOTAN &ndash; Splash Ceramic Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Botan brings a refreshing blend of simplicity and organic charm to your d&eacute;cor. Inspired by natural forms and soft botanical contours, this planter is designed to highlight the beauty of indoor greens with a clean, modern aesthetic. Its smooth ceramic finish, gentle curves, and balanced proportions make Botan a perfect fit for homes, studios, offices, and d&eacute;cor spaces that value subtle yet stylish design. Botan enhances your plants while adding a touch of calm sophistication to any setting.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Botan is defined by its sleek, rounded profile and naturally inspired silhouette.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The soft, minimal shape evokes a modern botanical essence.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">A gently tapered bottom ensures stability and visual harmony.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfectly proportioned for tabletops, consoles, and small d&eacute;cor corners.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its clean edges and fluid structure give it a contemporary and timeless appeal.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Botan ceramic planters are available in a refined mix of pastels, earthy tones, modern greys, and classic ceramic shades.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization options include:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple size variants ideal for desks, shelves, counters, and ledges</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Matte, glossy, or satin finish options</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom shades and textures for bulk orders or design projects, matching interior themes and branding</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern apartments, cozy bedrooms, and elegant living spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Work desks, reception counters, and minimal office interiors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Boutique stores, caf&eacute;s, and d&eacute;cor-forward commercial spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Styling shelves, window sills, study nooks, and coffee tables</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Plants like succulents, peperomia, syngonium, money plants, jade, nerve plants, and compact indoor foliage</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Botan</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Botan for its organic-inspired design, premium craftsmanship, and versatile styling appeal.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Enhances any d&eacute;cor without overwhelming it</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Durable ceramic build with a smooth, high-quality finish</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Complements both modern minimal and artistic interiors</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Easy to style and perfect for gifting or professional d&eacute;cor projects</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Botan brings the serenity of nature and the finesse of design together&mdash;making every plant look beautifully framed and thoughtfully placed.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774435259_69c3bbbbaa3ec.png\" style=\"height:176px; width:500px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Botan', 'Botan', 'Botan', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:41:11'),
(105, 'Dune Round', 'Dune Round', 'Dune Round', 10, 'dune-round', 'subsubcategories/1770896201.jpg', 'Dune Round', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770896201_3851.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770896201_8457.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770896201_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>DUNE ROUNDO &ndash; Splash Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Dune Roundo brings a beautiful blend of organic texture and smooth circular form to modern interiors. Inspired by natural dunes and gentle earth waves, this planter features subtle surface patterns and a rounded silhouette that create both visual depth and softness. Its refined ceramic finish and artistic curvature make it an elegant choice for homes, offices, studios, and d&eacute;cor-forward commercial spaces. Dune Roundo elevates greenery with a touch of natural artistry and timeless charm.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Dune Roundo stands out with its smooth, round profile paired with soft, dune-like textural detailing.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The rounded shape brings warmth and balance to any space.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Gentle ridges add an organic, handcrafted feel.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Works beautifully as a tabletop centerpiece or floor d&eacute;cor for smaller greens.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its symmetrical silhouette enhances both modern and earthy interior themes.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Dune Roundo is available in a curated selection of textured ceramic colours, ranging from warm neutrals to modern pastels and contemporary tones.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization options include:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple size options for desks, corners, consoles, and shelves</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish choices: matte, gloss, textured, or semi-matte</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom colour matching for bulk orders, interior projects, or branded spaces</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern living rooms, cozy bedrooms, and elegant study areas</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office desks, reception counters, and creative studio setups</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Boutique interiors, caf&eacute;s, spa spaces, and wellness zones</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Styling window sills, side tables, and d&eacute;cor ledges</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plants such as succulents, jade, money plant varieties, snake plant miniatures, peperomia, and ornamental foliage</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Dune Roundo</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Dune Roundo for its harmonious design, natural texture, and premium craftsmanship.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Adds an earthy yet modern aesthetic to d&eacute;cor</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">High-quality ceramic build ensures durability and long-lasting beauty</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Versatile enough to complement both minimal and richly styled interiors</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for enhancing plant displays in both small and medium spaces</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Dune Roundo combines the tranquility of nature with the finesse of contemporary design&mdash;creating a planter that feels both artistic and beautifully practical.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774435345_69c3bc116a8eb.png\" style=\"height:209px; width:500px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Dune Round', 'Dune Round', 'Dune Round', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:42:40');
INSERT INTO `sub_sub_categories` (`id`, `name`, `bread_heading`, `bread_subheading`, `subcategory_id`, `slug`, `image`, `alt`, `multi_images`, `breadimage`, `description`, `long_desc`, `sort`, `status`, `metatag`, `metadescription`, `metakeywords`, `metatags`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(106, 'Dune Square', 'Dune Square', 'Dune Square', 10, 'dune-square', 'subsubcategories/1770896311.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770896311_7531.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770896311_2786.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770896311_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><strong>DUNE SQUARE &ndash; Splash Ceramic Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Dune Square brings a modern architectural feel to indoor d&eacute;cor with its clean lines, structured silhouette, and subtle dune-inspired texture. The design blends contemporary geometry with organic detailing, creating a planter that feels both artistic and refined. Its elegant ceramic finish and balanced proportions make Dune Square an excellent choice for homes, offices, hospitality spaces, and stylish commercial interiors.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Dune Square is defined by its square profile softened with gentle, wave-like texture, offering a perfect fusion of structure and nature.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crisp square edges provide a sleek, modern appeal.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Vertical dune patterns add depth, dimension, and visual interest.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Stable base ensures confident placement on floors, consoles, corners, and window ledges.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The geometric shape enhances symmetry and is ideal for creating neat, organized visual arrangements.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Dune Square planter is available in a premium palette of Splash textured ceramic finishes designed to suit contemporary spaces.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization includes:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple size options for desktops, floors, shelves, and entryways</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choice of surface finishes: matte, gloss, textured, or semi-matte</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom colour matching for bulk orders, interior d&eacute;cor projects, or brand-specific themes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Availability in coordinated sets for cohesive styling</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern living rooms, bedrooms, and study corners</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office cabins, reception areas, and corporate meeting rooms</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Boutique stores, spas, salons, caf&eacute;s, and curated retail spaces</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bookshelves, window sills, console tables, work desks, and side tables</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfect for plants like succulents, aglaonema miniatures, small snake plants, pothos varieties, ZZ mini, indoor bonsai, and ornamental foliage</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Dune Square</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Dune Square for its perfect blend of geometry, texture, and craftsmanship.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Offers a clean, modern aesthetic suitable for contemporary d&eacute;cor</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">High-quality ceramic ensures durability and resistance to indoor wear</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The square shape maximizes space efficiency in tight or aligned layouts</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Textured surfaces add a premium, handcrafted look</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Versatile enough to elevate both minimal and richly decorated spaces</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Dune Square is the ideal ceramic planter for those who appreciate structured elegance enhanced with natural artistry.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774435431_69c3bc67e3d78.png\" style=\"height:162px; width:500px\" /></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Dune Square', 'Dune Square', 'Dune Square', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:44:08'),
(107, 'Marina', 'Marina', 'Marina', 10, 'marina', 'subsubcategories/1770896538.jpg', 'Marina', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770896538_6861.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770896538_9831.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770896538_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>MARINA &ndash; Splash Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Marina planter brings a refreshing, coastal-inspired charm to any setting. Designed with smooth contours and a subtle wave-like form, it captures the calming essence of water and movement. Its fluid silhouette and refined ceramic finish make it an ideal d&eacute;cor element for spaces that seek serenity, softness, and contemporary elegance. Marina is crafted to bring a soothing visual balance while highlighting your favourite indoor greens with effortless style.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Marina stands out with its rounded, gently tapered form and smooth surface that reflects minimalism at its best.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The soft splash-inspired shape adds a sense of flow and lightness.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Its balanced proportions make it suitable for both tabletops and floor placements.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The design complements compact plants while also giving breathing room to fuller decorative greens.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Marina planters are available in a beautiful palette of oceanic tones, soft pastels, warm neutrals, and contemporary ceramic shades.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization options include:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple sizes for desks, corners, consoles, and side tables</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish options such as matte, satin, semi-gloss, or artisanal textured coats</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom colours for bulk orders to match branding, interior themes, or project aesthetics</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern apartments and cosy living rooms</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Bedrooms, study corners, and reading nooks needing subtle d&eacute;cor highlights</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Boutique stores, spas, and caf&eacute;s wanting a calming, coastal design appeal</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Reception desks, studio setups, and styling shelves</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plants like money plants, syngoniums, succulents, nerve plants, fittonia, small ferns, and flowering tabletop varieties</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Marina</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Marina for its timeless curves, premium ceramic craftsmanship, and universally appealing design.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Adds elegance without overwhelming the d&eacute;cor</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Highly durable ceramic with a refined handcrafted finish</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Complements both minimal and vibrant interiors</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Easy to style and perfect for accent d&eacute;cor and gifting</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Marina brings a refreshing, modern splash of character to your space&mdash;making every plant look beautifully curated.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774435511_69c3bcb78b5e2.png\" style=\"height:202px; width:500px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Marina', 'Marina', 'Marina', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:45:31'),
(108, 'Melony', 'Melony', 'Melony', 10, 'melony', 'subsubcategories/1770896626.jpg', 'Melony', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770896626_8720.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770896626_9687.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770896626_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h3><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>MELONY &ndash; Splash Ceramic Planters</strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Melony brings a fresh, playful elegance to your d&eacute;cor with its soft rounded silhouette and smooth, fruit-inspired contours. Designed to resemble the gentle curves of a melon, this planter adds warmth, creativity, and charm to any room. Its balanced shape and refined ceramic finish make it a versatile d&eacute;cor accent&mdash;perfect for modern homes, cozy corners, stylish studios, and contemporary office spaces. Melony is crafted to elevate small to medium indoor plants with a touch of artistic personality.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Melony stands out for its rounded, melon-like form that adds both softness and visual appeal.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Smooth curves and a full-bodied shape give it a warm, organic presence.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Perfectly symmetrical design enhances modern minimal and contemporary styles.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ideal for small greens that benefit from a cozy, spacious base&mdash;balancing d&eacute;cor with natural charm.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Melony planters come in a delightful selection of modern ceramic colours, including soft pastels, earthy tones, neutrals, and vibrant statement shades.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization options include:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple size variants for shelves, desks, corners, and side tables</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Matte, gloss, and semi-textured finish options</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom colour and finish requests for bulk and interior design projects</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern living rooms, bedrooms, and study areas</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Office desks, reception counters, and meeting rooms</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Stylish caf&eacute;s, boutique stores, and creative spaces</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shelving units, window sills, and d&eacute;cor ledges</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Indoor plants like succulents, jade, money plants, air-purifying greens, syngoniums, and small decorative foliage</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Melony</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Melony for its blend of art-inspired design, durability, and effortless elegance.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Adds a soft, contemporary aesthetic to any room</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">High-quality ceramic craftsmanship with smooth premium finishing</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Versatile for both minimal and colorful d&eacute;cor themes</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Easy to style and perfect for thoughtful gifting</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Melony brings a refreshing, modern charm&mdash;making every plant look more vibrant, stylish, and beautifully placed.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774435585_69c3bd018d486.png\" style=\"height:341px; width:500px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Melony', 'Melony', 'Melony', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:46:39'),
(109, 'Mimbus Binge', 'Mimbus Binge', 'Mimbus Binge', 10, 'nimbus-binge', 'subsubcategories/1770896711.png', 'Mimbus Binge', '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770896711_6031.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770896711_6069.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770896711_breadcrumb.png', '<h3><strong>NIMBUS / BINGE &ndash; Splash Ceramic Planters</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Nimbus/Binge is crafted to bring a soft, cloud-like charm to your interiors. With its rounded form and gentle contours, this planter adds a soothing, airy presence to any d&eacute;cor setting. Designed to feel light, elegant, and welcoming, it blends the essence of minimalism with artistic expression. Perfect for modern homes and creative spaces, Nimbus/Binge enhances your plants with a calm, contemporary character that stands out effortlessly.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Shape Specialization</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Nimbus/Binge is defined by its smooth, cloud-inspired silhouette&mdash;soft, rounded, and visually comforting.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The design mimics the organic fullness of a floating cloud.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Rounded curves add warmth and fluidity to any d&eacute;cor theme.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Ideal for both tabletop styling and low-height floor d&eacute;cor, offering a balanced and symmetrical profile.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization Options</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Nimbus/Binge ceramic planters come in a curated palette of soft neutrals, warm pastels, modern greys, and contemporary accent colours.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Customization options include:</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Multiple size variants suitable for shelves, side tables, and corner d&eacute;cor</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Finish choices in matte, gloss, satin, or hand-textured coatings</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Custom colour development for bulk orders, interior designers, and project requirements</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Best Used For</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Modern living rooms, bedrooms, and work-from-home setups</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Study desks, reception counters, and minimal office d&eacute;cor</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Boutique stores, caf&eacute;s, wellness studios, and display corners</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Window sills, shelving units, consoles, and styling ledges</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Plants like succulents, money plant varieties, fittonia, syngonium, peperomia, and small flowering greens</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Why Choose Nimbus/Binge</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Choose Nimbus/Binge for its calming design, premium ceramic build, and versatility.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Adds a soft, peaceful aesthetic to any interior</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Crafted with high-quality ceramic for durability and long-lasting finish</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Complements both minimal and expressive d&eacute;cor themes</span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Easy to pair with various small to medium indoor plants</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Nimbus/Binge brings an airy, contemporary freshness&mdash;making your greenery look more curated, gentle, and beautifully placed.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://yuccabeplanters.co.in/cms_forY/public/uploads/1774435672_69c3bd586fded.png\" style=\"height:275px; width:500px\" /></span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 1, 'Mimbus Binge', 'Mimbus Binge', 'Mimbus Binge', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-25 17:48:04'),
(111, 'GL-Cube & GL-tray', NULL, NULL, 1, 'gl-cube-gl-tray', 'subsubcategories/1770880111.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770880111_4307.jpg\",\"subsubcategories\\/1770880111_6472.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770880111_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h4><strong>GL Cube &amp; GL Tray Planters</strong></h4><p>The FRP GL Cube &amp; GL Tray Planters feature clean geometric structures that bring a refined modern touch to interior and exterior décor. Crafted from premium FRP, they offer durability and elegant design.</p><p><strong>Shape Specialization:</strong></p><ul><li>GL Cube: Bold structured cube ideal for statement plants</li><li>GL Tray: Low elongated tray perfect for tabletop &amp; windowsill styling</li></ul><p><strong>Customization Options:</strong></p><ul><li>Wide range of sizes &amp; shapes</li><li>Multiple finishes—matte, glossy, metallic &amp; designer shades</li></ul><p><strong>Best Used For:</strong></p><ul><li>Residential interiors &amp; balconies</li><li>Corporate spaces &amp; reception zones</li><li>Hotels, cafés &amp; lounges</li><li>Terrace gardens &amp; decorative corners</li><li>Premium plant displays &amp; linear arrangements</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, 'GL-Cube & GL-tray', 'GL-Cube & GL-tray', 'GL-Cube & GL-tray', NULL, '2026-02-12 14:08:31', '2026-02-12 14:08:31'),
(112, 'SQ-RIB & SQ-RIB TRAY', NULL, NULL, 1, 'sq-rib-sq-rib-tray', 'subsubcategories/1770880292.jpg', NULL, '[\"subsubcategories\\/1770880292_9667.jpg\"]', 'subsubcategories/1770880292_breadcrumb.jpg', '<h4><strong>SQ Rib &amp; SQ Rib Tray FRP Planters</strong></h4><p>The FRP SQ Rib &amp; SQ Rib Tray Planters are designed to deliver a modern, structured, and impactful aesthetic to both indoor and outdoor spaces. Crafted from premium FRP, they offer excellent durability, weather resistance, and long-lasting performance.</p><p><strong>Shape Specialization:</strong></p><ul><li>SQ Rib (Cube Type): Square profile with vertical ribbed detailing for modern symmetry.</li><li>SQ Rib Tray: Shorter, wider square tray with ribbed texture for layered arrangements.</li></ul><p><strong>Customization Options:</strong></p><ul><li>Available in multiple sizes—from compact to large landscape formats</li><li>Color options include matte, gloss, textured, metallic &amp; custom finishes</li></ul><p><strong>Best Used For:</strong></p><ul><li>Office lobbies &amp; corporate spaces</li><li>Balconies, terraces &amp; patios</li><li>Villa entrances &amp; walkways</li><li>Hotel corridors &amp; lounges</li><li>Showrooms &amp; boutique interiors</li><li>Window-side arrangements &amp; indoor corners</li></ul>', NULL, 1, 1, 'SQ Rib & SQ Rib Tray FRP Planters', 'SQ Rib & SQ Rib Tray FRP Planters', 'SQ Rib & SQ Rib Tray FRP Planters', NULL, '2026-02-12 14:11:32', '2026-02-12 14:11:32');

