(1, 'Company Profile', 'Lenova Industry', '<p>Located in the prime location of Delhi, India, we, Lenova Industries, are engrossed in bringing forth innovative and high performing range of home appliances. These appliances include Water Heater, Air Cooler, Monoblock Pump and Pedestal Fan. The provided appliances are power efficient and are used in every home, shops and many other commercial places for their unmatched attributes. Some noted features of these appliances are an easy installation, strong design, low maintenance, and high efficiency. Further, we promote a healthy working environment for the employees that helps in maintaining consistency in the quality of the products and improvement in the teamwork.</p>\r\n', '1748424773_companyheater.png', 'Company Profile', '                            <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n                                <thead class=\"table-light\">\r\n                                    <tr>\r\n                                        <th colspan=\"2\">Key Facts</th>\r\n                                    </tr>\r\n                                </thead>\r\n                                <tbody>\r\n                                    <tr>\r\n                                        <td>Nature of Business</td>\r\n                                        <td>Manufacturer, Wholesaler, Distributor & Supplier</td>\r\n                                    </tr>\r\n                                    <tr>\r\n                                        <td>Year of Establishment</td>\r\n                                        <td>1988</td>\r\n                                    </tr>\r\n                                    <tr>\r\n                                        <td>No. of Employees</td>\r\n                                        <td>21</td>\r\n                                    </tr>\r\n                                    <tr>\r\n                                        <td>No. of Engineers</td>\r\n                       