(1, 'Founder and Principal Architect', 'Ar. Abhishek Aggarwal', '<p>Ar. <strong>Abhishek Aggarwal</strong> is a seasoned architect with extensive professional experience in architecture and planning. Since beginning his career in 1996, he has focused on delivering practical, efficient&nbsp;and context-responsive design solutions that address functional and environmental needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>He founded <strong>Aggarwal Designer Pvt. Ltd.</strong> in 1998, and under his leadership, the firm has delivered over 1,500 projects across residential, institutional, industrial, commercial&nbsp;and infrastructure sectors in India and internationally. His approach emphasizes technical clarity, sustainable practices&nbsp;and Vaastu integration where required, ensuring responsible and performance-driven architectural development.</p>\r\n', '1770357598_1769517700_ABHISHEK SIR.jpg', 'founder Image');

